i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles" aria-hidden="true"></i> WAFA SMART TECH Codes — done for you</p> <a class="biz-item" href="codes#svc-codes-dynamic-qr"><i class="fa-solid fa-qrcode" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>Dynamic QR, 1 year</b><small>A QR code you can re-point at any time, with a scan count — for packaging, menus, flyers and shop windows.</small></span></a><a class="biz-item" href="codes#svc-codes-barcode-artwork"><i class="fa-solid fa-barcode" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>Barcode artwork, done for you</b><small>Your GTINs checked and drawn print-ready — EAN-13, UPC-A, EAN-8 or UPC-E at the right size for your pack, with an A4 label sheet.</small></span></a><a class="biz-item" href="codes#svc-codes-carton-labels"><i class="fa-solid fa-box" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>Carton &amp; logistics labels</b><small>ITF-14 for outer cartons and GS1-128 labels with batch, expiry and weight — drawn and laid out for your cartons.</small></span></a><a class="biz-item" href="codes#svc-codes-sku-system"><i class="fa-solid fa-tags" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>SKU &amp; stock-code system</b><small>A clean SKU plan for your range, with a Code 128 stock barcode for every item — ready for your shelves, POS and spreadsheet.</small></span></a><a class="biz-item" href="codes#svc-codes-gs1-guidance"><i class="fa-solid fa-headset" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>GS1 guidance call, 30 minutes</b><small>A private 30-minute video call in the WAFA SMART TECH Meeting Room: how to get your own GTINs from GS1 Pakistan or GS1 UAE, step by step.</small></span></a> <a class="biz-all" href="codes#services">All services &amp; prices <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a> </div> <div class="biz-col"> <p class="biz-k"><i class="fa-solid fa-handshake" aria-hidden="true"></i> Earn &amp; grow with WAFA SMART TECH</p> <a class="biz-item" href="/earn#b2b"><i class="fa-solid fa-store" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>Wholesale &amp; B2B</b><small>Shops, pharma