detail&quot;:&quot;Our production partner operates to ISO 22716, the good-manufacturing-practice standard written for cosmetics — covering premises, equipment, raw-material handling and batch records.&quot;,&quot;doc&quot;:&quot;assets/images/certificates/cert-gmp-halal-iso.png&quot;}'> <span class="cs-seal"><img src="assets/images/stamps/stamp-gmp-cleanroom.png" alt="" width="46" height="46" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span> <span class="cs-txt"><b>Made to ISO 22716 GMP</b><small>Cosmetic good manufacturing practice</small></span> </button> <button class="cs-cert" type="button" style="--i:2" data-doc='{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Halal certified&quot;,&quot;line&quot;:&quot;No animal-derived ingredients&quot;,&quot;detail&quot;:&quot;The formula is entirely plant-based, with no animal-derived or alcohol-based ingredients, and is halal certified.&quot;,&quot;doc&quot;:&quot;assets/images/certificates/cert-gmp-halal-iso.png&quot;}'> <span class="cs-seal"><img src="assets/images/stamps/stamp-halal-trust.png" alt="" width="46" height="46" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span> <span class="cs-txt"><b>Halal certified</b><small>No animal-derived ingredients</small></span> </button> <button class="cs-cert" type="button" style="--i:3" data-doc='{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Independently lab tested&quot;,&quot;line&quot;:&quot;PCSIR analysis on file&quot;,&quot;detail&quot;:&quot;Batch samples are analysed by PCSIR Laboratories. The report covers composition and purity and is available on request.&quot;,&quot;doc&quot;:&quot;assets/images/certificates/cert-pakistan-pcsir-report.png&quot;}'> <span class="cs-seal"><img src="assets/images/stamps/stamp-pcsir-certified.png" alt="" width="46" height="46" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span> <span class="cs-txt"><b>Independently lab tested</b><small>PCSIR analysis on file</small></span> </button> </div> </div> </section> <div class="sec-seam" aria-hidden="true"></div> <section class="qc-sec eco-light" id="quick" aria-label="Shop