port</b> </a> <a class="qc" href="shop/foods"> <span class="qc-img"><img src="assets/images/eco/murabba-jar-sm.webp" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy"></span> <b>Murabba &amp; foods</b> </a> <a class="qc" href="shop/gifts"> <span class="qc-img"><img src="assets/images/v50/gift-her-sm.webp" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy"></span> <b>Gifts</b> </a> <a class="qc" href="shop/fragrance"> <span class="qc-img"><img src="assets/images/eco/soon-oud-sm.webp" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy"><em>Soon</em></span> <b>Oud &amp; fragrance</b> </a> <a class="qc" href="shop/baby"> <span class="qc-img"><img src="assets/images/eco/life-baby-sm.webp" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy"><em>Next</em></span> <b>Baby care</b> </a> <a class="qc" href="shop/beauty"> <span class="qc-img"><img src="assets/images/v49/white-serum-sm.webp" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy"></span> <b>Beauty</b> </a> <a class="qc" href="shop/home"> <span class="qc-img"><img src="assets/images/eco/soon-towels-sm.webp" alt="" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy"><em>Soon</em></span> <b>Home &amp; living</b> </a> </div> </div> </section> <div class="sec-seam" aria-hidden="true"></div> <section class="section eco-dark signature" id="signature"> <div class="wrap wrap-wide lh-grid"> <div class="lh-copy"> <span class="eyebrow" data-reveal>The Signature Collection</span> <h2 class="split-words" data-reveal data-split>Every house. <em>One box.</em></h2> <p class="lead" data-reveal>Cold-pressed herbal oil and the Herbal Radiance Cream, hand-embroidered suits, heritage preserves and dry fruits — each presented in the black-and-gold WAFA SMART TECH box, ready to give or to keep.</p> <ul class="sig-list" data-reveal> <li><i class="fa-solid fa-leaf" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>Herbal</b> — 7 botanicals, no mineral oil</span></li> <li><i class="fa-solid fa-shirt" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>Garments</b> — 100% combed cotton, S–XXL</span></li> <li><i class="fa-solid fa-crown" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>Winter &#039;26</b> — hand-embroidered suits, 18 designs</span></li> <li><i class="fa-solid fa-jar" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>Foods</b> — murabba, achaar, dates, dry fruits &amp; WAFA SMART TECH Fresh</span></li> <li><i class="fa-solid fa-spa" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>Beauty</b> — the Herbal Radiance Cream, serums, sun care &amp; the face wash</span></li> <li><i class="fa-solid fa-gift" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>Gift sets</b> — from Rs. 2,399</span></li> </ul> <div class="eh-cta" data-reveal><a class="btn btn-gold btn-lg magnetic" href="/#sets"><i class="fa-solid fa-gift" aria-hidden="true"></i> See the gift sets</a><a class="btn btn-ghost on-dark btn-lg" href="/shop">Shop everything</a></div> </div> <div class="stage lh-stage" data-stage> <div class="stage-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div> <div class="stage-ring r3" aria-hidden="true"></div> <div class="stage-ring" aria-hidden="true"></div> <div class="stage-ring r2" aria-hidden="true"></div> <div class="stage-product" data-tilt data-tilt-max="6"> <img src="assets/images/v50/hero-stage.webp" alt="The House of WAFA SMART TECH: organic hair oil, the Herbal Radiance Cream, a serum, aam ka murabba, dry fruits and an embroidered suit in its black WAFA SMART TECH box, with gold ribbon" width="1024" height="1024" loading="lazy"> </div> <div class="stage-shadow" aria-hidden="true"></div> <a class="lh-sat s1" href="/shop/foods" data-sat="1.1" aria-label="WAFA SMART TECH dry fruits"><img src="assets/images/v49/pistachios-sm.webp" alt="" width="500" height="625" loading="lazy"></a> <a class="lh-sat s2" href="/shop/beauty" data-sat="0.8" aria-label="WAFA SMART TECH sunscreen gel SPF 60"><img src="assets/images/v50/sun-gel-3-sm.webp" alt="" width="500" height="625" loading="lazy"></a> <span class="spec-chip c1" data-depth="0.9"><i class="fa-solid fa-spa" aria-hidden="true"></i> Herbal Radiance Cream</span> <span class="spec-chip c2" data-depth="1.2"><i class="fa-solid fa-crown" aria-hidden="true"></i> Hand-embroidered suits</span> <span class="spec-chip c3" data-depth="0.7"><i class="fa-solid fa-gift" aria-hidden="true"></i> Boxed in black &amp; gold</span> </div> </div> </section> <div class="sec-seam" aria-hidden="true"></div> <section class="season-band is-winter" id="season" aria-label="WAFA SMART TECH Winter &#039;26"> <div class="sb-media" aria-hidden="true"> <img src="assets/videos/eco/v51-haveli.webp?v=tnoweh" alt="" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> <video muted loop playsinline preload="none" data-lazy-poster="assets/videos/eco/v51-haveli.webp?v=tnoweh" data-src="assets/videos/eco/v51-haveli.mp4?v=tnoweh" data-src-m="assets/videos/eco/v51-haveli-m.mp4?v=tnoweg" data-ugc></video> </div> <div class="sb-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div> <div class="wrap wrap-wide sb-inner"> <div class="sb-copy"> <span class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Now in the House · Winter &#039;26</span> <h2 data-reveal>The <em>Winter &#039;26</em> Collection</h2> <p class="lead" data-reveal>Hand-embroidered dhanak, fancy peach and velvet chamki suits with heavy embroidered dupattas, each design in its full range of colours. Every unstitched three-piece leaves folded in ivory tissue and sealed in the WAFA SMART TECH courier flyer, printed in gold — or in the WAFA SMART TECH gift box when it is a gift.</p> <ul class="sb-facts" data-reveal> <li><b>18</b><span>designs</span></li> <li><b>112</b><span>colourways</span></li> <li><b>3-piece</b><span>shirt · shawl · trouser</span></li> </ul> <div class="eh-cta" data-reveal> <a class="btn btn-gold btn-lg magnetic" href="shop/garments/women-unstitched"><i class="fa-solid fa-crown" aria-hidden="true"></i> Shop the collection</a> <a class="btn btn-ghost on-dark btn-lg" href="product/mens-unstitched-suit">Men's suits<span class="sb-more"> · stitched by WAFA SMART TECH</span></a> </div> <small class="sb-note">Styled House film</small> </div> </div> <div class="wrap wrap-wide sb-rail sb-all-rail" 