 fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a> </div> <div class="p-rail" data-drag> <a class="p-card has-alt" href="product/shafaq-embroidered-dhanak-suit-sf-135" data-reveal> <span class="p-img tall"> <img src="assets/images/v51/suits/shafaq-maroon.webp" alt="WAFA SMART TECH Shafaq · SF-135" loading="lazy" width="832" height="1040"> <img class="p-alt" src="assets/images/v51/suits/shafaq-maroon-d.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" width="832" height="1040"> <em class="p-badge">New · Winter &#039;26</em> </span> <span class="p-body"> <small class="p-brand">WAFA SMART TECH<sup class="tm">™</sup></small> <b class="p-name">Shafaq · SF-135</b> <span class="p-short">Dyed dhanak with a two-head embroidered front and sleeves, and a lace-edged dupatta — six winter colours.</span> <span class="p-sw"><i title="Maroon" style="background-image:url(assets/images/v51/suits/shafaq-maroon-d-sm.webp)"></i><i title="Black" style="background-image:url(assets/images/v51/suits/shafaq-black-d-sm.webp)"></i><i title="Rust" style="background-image:url(assets/images/v51/suits/shafaq-rust-d-sm.webp)"></i><i title="Pistachio" style="background-image:url(assets/images/v51/suits/shafaq-pistachio-d-sm.webp)"></i><i title="Navy" style="background-image:url(assets/images/v51/suits/shafaq-navy-d-sm.webp)"></i><span>6 colours</span></span> <span class="p-price"><span class="from">from</span> Rs. 8,450 <s>Rs. 9,950</s></span> <span class="p-cta">Choose options <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span> </span> </a> <a class="p-card has-alt" href="product/whitening-serum" data-reveal> <span class="p-img"> <img src="assets/images/v49/white-serum.webp" alt="WAFA SMART TECH Whitening Serum" loading="lazy" width="832" height="1040"> <img class="p-alt" src="assets/images/v49/white-serum-2.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" width="832" height="1040"> <em class="p-badge">New</em> </span> <span class="p-body"> <small class="p-brand">WAFA SMART TECH<sup class="tm">™</sup></small> <b class="p-name">Whitening Serum</b> <span class="p-short">Hyaluronic acid 2% and niacinamide 1% in a light, fast-absorbing serum for a brighter, more even-looking complexion. 30 ml.</span> <span class="p-price"><span class="from">from</span> Rs. 2,250 <s>Rs. 2,750</s></span> <span class="p-cta">Choose options <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span> </span> </a> <a class="p-card has-alt" href="herbal" data-reveal> <span class="p-img"> <img src="assets/images/v3/composition.webp" alt="WAFA SMART TECH Organic Hair Oil" loading="lazy" width="832" height="1040"> <img class="p-alt" src="assets/images/hero-product.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="832" height="1040"> <em class="p-badge">Bestseller</em> </span> <span class="p-body"> <small class="p-brand">WAFA SMART TECH<sup class="tm">™</sup></small> <b class="p-name">Organic Hair Oil</b> <span class="p-short">Cold-pressed onion, kalonji &amp; coconut. 7 botanicals, no mineral oil.</span> <span class="p-price"><span class="from">from</span> Rs. 2,299 <s>Rs. 2,999</s></span> <span class="p-cta">Shop the oil <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span> </span> </a> <a class="p-card has-alt" href="product/dry-fruit-reserve" data-reveal> <span class="p-img"> <img src="assets/images/v46/soon-dry-fruit-box.webp" alt="WAFA SMART TECH The Dry Fruit Reserve" loading="lazy" width="832" height="1040"> <img class="p-alt" src="assets/images/v49/almonds.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" width="832" height="1040"> <em class="p-badge">Eid &amp; weddings</em> </span> <span class="p-body"> <small class="p-brand">WAFA SMART TECH<sup class="tm">™</sup></small> <b class="p-name">The Dry Fruit Reserve</b> <span class="p-short">Eight compartments of almonds, pistachios, cashews, walnuts, raisins, apricots, figs and chickpeas in the octagonal black-and-gold WAFA SMART TECH box.</span> <span class="p-price"><span class="from">from</span> Rs. 6,950 <s>Rs. 7,950</s></span> <span class="p-cta">Choose options <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span> </span> </a> <a class="p-card has-alt" href="product/mens-washwear-suit" data-reveal> <span class="p-img"> <img src="assets/images/v52/men/fabric-washwear.webp" alt="WAFA SMART TECH Wash &amp; Wear Men&#039;s Suit" loading="lazy" width="832" height="1040"> <img class="p-alt" src="assets/images/v53/men/touch-washwear.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" width="832" height="1040"> <em class="p-badge">Everyday</em> </span> <span class="p-body"> <small class="p-brand">WAFA SMART TECH<sup class="tm">™</sup></small> <b class="p-name">Wash &amp; Wear Men&#039;s Suit</b> <span class="p-short">Easy care, all day — the everyday cloth. It sheds creases, dries quickly and keeps a clean line from the office to the evening. Jet Black, Pure White or Steel Grey; 4.5 m unstitched or stitched by WAFA SMART TECH.</span> <span class="p-sw"><i title="Jet Black" style="background:#111111"></i><i title="Pure White" style="background:#F6F3EC"></i><i title="Steel Grey" style="background:#7B7F86"></i><span>3 colours</span></span> <span class="p-price"><span class="from">from</span> Rs. 7,950 <s>Rs. 9,500</s></span> <span class="p-cta">Choose options <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span> </span> </a> <a class="p-card has-alt" href="product/transparent-sunscreen-gel-spf-60" data-reveal> <span class="p-img"> <img src="assets/images/v50/sun-gel.webp" alt="WAFA SMART TECH Transparent Sunscreen Gel SPF 60" loading="lazy" width="832" height="1040"> <img class="p-alt" src="assets/images/v50/sun-gel-2.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" width="832" height="1040"> <em class="p-badge">New</em> </span> <span class="p-body"> <small class="p-brand">WAFA SMART TECH<sup class="tm">™</sup></small> <b class="p-name">Transparent Sunscreen Gel SPF 60</b> <span class="p-short">SPF 60 · PA+++ broad-spectrum UVA/UVB protection in a clear, weightless gel — no white cast, made for the Gulf sun. 150 ml.</span> <span class="p-price"><span class="from">from</span> Rs. 1,850 <s>Rs. 2,250</s></span> <span class="p-cta">Choose options <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span> </span> </a> <a class="p-card has-alt" href="product/hair-and-scalp-serum" data-reveal> <span class="p-img"> <img src="assets/images/v49/hair-serum.webp" alt="WAFA SMART TECH Hair &amp; Scalp Serum" loading="lazy" width="832" height="1040"> <img class="p-alt" src="assets/images/v49/hair-serum-2.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" width="832" height="1040"> <em class="p-badge">New</em> </span> <span class="p-body"> <small class="p-brand">WAFA SMART TECH<sup class="tm">™</sup></small> <b class="p-name">Hair &amp; Scalp Serum</b> <span class="p-short">A lightweight leave-on oil serum with rosemary, onion seed and kalonji in jojoba, for the scalp and fine, thinning-looking hair. 30 ml, in black glass with a gold collar.</span> <span class="p-price"><span class="from">from</span> Rs. 1,950 <s>Rs. 2,450</s></span> <span class="p-cta">Choose options <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span> </span> </a> <a class="p-card has-alt" href="product/aam-ka-murabba" data-reveal> <span class="p-img"> <img src="assets/images/eco/murabba-jar.webp" alt="WAFA SMART TECH Aam ka Murabba" loading="lazy" width="832" height="1040"> <img class="p-alt" src="assets/images/eco/banner-breakfast.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" width="832" height="1040"> <em class="p-badge">New</em> </span> <span class="p-body"> <small class="p-brand">WAFA SMART TECH<sup class="tm">™</sup></small> <b class="p-name">Aam ka Murabba</b> <span class="p-short">The mango preserve of Pakistani kitchens — whole raw-mango pieces slow-cooked in saffron and cardamom syrup.</span> <span class="p-price"><span class="from">from</span> Rs. 1,450 <s>Rs. 1,650</s></span> <span class="p-cta">Choose options <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span> </span> </a> <a class="p-card has-alt" href="product/pure-cotton-vest" data-reveal> <span class="p-img"> <img src="assets/images/eco/vest-box.webp" alt="WAFA SMART TECH Pure Cotton Vest" loading="lazy" width="832" height="1040"> <img class="p-alt" src="assets/images/eco/vest-onyx.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" width="832" height="1040"> <em class="p-badge">New</em> </span> <span class="p-body"> <small class="p-brand">WAFA SMART TECH<sup class="tm">™</sup></small> <b class="p-name">Pure Cotton Vest</b> <span class="p-short">The banyan, perfected: 100% combed-cotton rib-knit that breathes through Pakistan&#039;s summer.</span> <span class="p-sw"><i title="Pearl White" style="background:#F4F1EA"></i><i title="Onyx Black" style="background:#1A1A1C"></i><span>2 colours</span></span> <span class="p-price"><span class="from">from</span> Rs. 999 <s>Rs. 1,199</s></span> <span class="p-cta">Choose options <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span> </span> </a> <a class="p-card has-alt" href="product/face-wash" data-reveal> <span class="p-img"> <img src="assets/images/v49/face-wash.webp" alt="WAFA SMART TECH Face Wash" loading="lazy" width="832" height="1040"> <img class="p-alt" src="assets/images/v49/face-wash-2.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" width="832" height="1040"> <em class="p-badge">New</em> </span> <span class="p-body"> <small class="p-brand">WAFA SMART TECH<sup class="tm">™</sup></small> <b class="p-name">Face Wash</b> <span class="p-short">A gentle daily cleanser that lifts away dust, sunscreen and the day — and never leaves skin tight. 100 ml.</span> <span class="p-price"><span class="from">from</span> Rs. 1,250 <s>Rs. 1,550</s></span> <span class="p-cta">Choose options <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span> </span> </a> </div> </div> </section> <div class="sec-seam" aria-hidden="true"></div><section class="scene55" style="--pos:50% 35%" aria-label="The moment the box opens"><div class="sc55-bg" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/images/v55/people-eid.webp?v=tnowdc" srcset="assets/images/v55/people-eid-sm.webp 960w, assets/images/v55/people-eid.webp 1920w" sizes="100vw" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="sc55-veil" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wrap wrap-wide sc55-copy" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">Gifts, given by hand</span><h2>The moment <em>the box opens</em></h2><p>Sealed in black and gold and ready to give — for Eid, for weddings and for every visit home.</p><a class="btn btn-gold" href="shop/gifts">Choose a gift <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></div></section> <section class="section eco-stone gift-salon" id="gifts" aria-label="Gifts for everyone"> <div class="wrap wrap-wide"> <div class="section-head"> <span class="eyebrow center" data-reveal>The WAFA SMART TECH gift salon</span> <h2 class="split-words" data-reveal data-split>A gift for <em>everyone you love</em></h2> <p class="lead" data-reveal>Ready-made gift boxes for him, her, Abbu, Ammi and your sister — boxed in the WAFA SMART TECH gift box with a handwritten card, delivered to their door. From Rs. 899.</p> </div> <div class="gs-films n-2"> <a class="gs-film" href="shop/gifts" data-reveal> <video muted loop playsinline preload="none" data-lazy-poster="assets/videos/eco/house-gift-salon.webp?v=tnowds" data-lazy-bg data-src="assets/videos/eco/house-gift-salon.mp4?v=tnowdv" data-ugc aria-label="The WAFA SMART TECH gift salon"></video> <span class="pf-cap"><i class="fa-solid fa-play" aria-hidden="true"></i> The WAFA SMART TECH gift salon<em>Styled film</em></span> </a> <a class="gs-film" href="shop/gifts" data-reveal> <video muted loop playsinline preload="none" data-lazy-poster="assets/videos/eco/house-winter-giftwrap.webp?v=tnowdt" data-lazy-bg data-src="assets/videos/eco/house-winter-giftwrap.mp4?v=tnowdu" data-ugc aria-label="Wrapped for Winter &#039;26"></video> <span class="pf-cap"><i class="fa-solid fa-play" aria-hidden="true"></i> Wrapped for Winter &#039;26<em>Styled film</em></span> </a> </div> <div class="gift-grid g-8"> <a class="gift-tile lead" href="shop/gifts/eid-gift-boxes" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:0ms"> <span class="gt-img"><img src="assets/images/v48/eid-closed.webp?v=tnowc6" alt="WAFA SMART TECH gift box — Eid gift boxes" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span> <span class="gt-body"><b>Eid gift boxes</b><small>See the gift boxes <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></small></span> </a> <a class="gift-tile" href="shop/gifts/for-him" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:60ms"> <span class="gt-img"><img src="assets/images/v48b/gift-him-sm.webp?v=tnowcj" alt="WAFA SMART TECH gift box — For him" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span> <span class="gt-body"><b>For him</b><small>See the gift boxes <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></small></span> </a> <a class="gift-tile" href="shop/gifts/for-her" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:120ms"> <span class="gt-img"><img src="assets/images/v50/gift-her-sm.webp?v=tnowd1" alt="WAFA SMART TECH gift box — For her" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span> <span class="gt-body"><b>For her</b><small>See the gift boxes <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></small></span> </a> <a class="gift-tile" href="shop/gifts/for-abbu" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:180ms"> <span class="gt-img"><img src="assets/images/v50/gift-abbu-sm.webp?v=tnowd1" alt="WAFA SMART TECH gift box — For Abbu · father" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span> <span class="gt-body"><b>For Abbu · father</b><small>See the gift boxes <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></small></span> </a> <a class="gift-tile" href="shop/gifts/for-ammi" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:240ms"> <span class="gt-img"><img src="assets/images/v50/gift-ammi-sm.webp?v=tnowd1" alt="WAFA SMART TECH gift box — For Ammi · mother" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span> <span class="gt-body"><b>For Ammi · mother</b><small>See the gift boxes <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></small></span> </a> <a class="gift-tile" href="shop/gifts/for-sister" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:300ms"> <span class="gt-img"><img src="assets/images/v50/gift-sister-sm.webp?v=tnowd2" alt="WAFA SMART TECH gift box — For my sister" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span> <span class="gt-body"><b>For my sister</b><small>See the gift boxes <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></small></span> </a> <a class="gift-tile" href="shop/gifts/for-couples" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:360ms"> <span class="gt-img"><img src="assets/images/v48b/gift-couple-sm.webp?v=tnowcj" alt="WAFA SMART TECH gift box — For the two of you" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span> <span class="gt-body"><b>For the two of you</b><small>See the gift boxes <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></small></span> </a> <a class="gift-tile is-soon" href="shop/gifts/for-baby" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:360ms"> <span class="gt-img"><img src="assets/images/v50/gift-baby-sm.webp?v=tnowd1" alt="WAFA SMART TECH gift box — For the baby" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span> <span class="gt-body"><b>For the baby</b><small>Opening soon</small></span> </a> </div> </div> </section> <div class="sec-seam" aria-hidden="true"></div> <section class="sd53" id="same-day" aria-label="WAFA SMART TECH Same-Day"> <div class="wrap wrap-wide sd53-in"> <figure class="sd53-media" data-reveal> <img src="assets/images/v53/sameday.webp?v=tnowd7" alt="A black WAFA SMART TECH gift box with an emerald ribbon on a marble console at golden hour" width="2048" height="1152" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> <video muted loop playsinline preload="none" data-lazy-poster="assets/images/v53/sameday.webp?v=tnowd7" data-scene data-src="assets/videos/eco/v53-sameday.mp4?v=tnowet" aria-hidden="true"></video> <figcaption><i class="fa-regular fa-clock" aria-hidden="true"></i> Last same-day order 5:00 pm</figcaption> </figure> <div class="sd53-copy"> <span class="eyebrow" data-reveal>A House privilege · WAFA SMART TECH Same-Day</span> <h2 data-reveal>Ordered by five. <em>Yours by evening.</em></h2> <p class="lead" data-reveal>In Lahore, Islamabad, Rawalpindi, Faisalabad and Multan, the House sends your order the same day — paid in advance, sealed in black and gold, and ready for you to collect in your city that evening.</p> <form class="sd53-check" data-sd-check data-reveal autocomplete="off"> <label for="sdCity" class="sr-only">Your city</label> <input id="sdCity" name="city" list="sdCities" placeholder="Your city — e.g. Lahore" maxlength="40"> <datalist id="sdCities"><option value="Lahore"><option value="Islamabad"><option value="Rawalpindi"><option value="Faisalabad"><option value="Multan"></datalist> <button class="btn btn-gold" type="submit">Is it today?</button> <p class="sd53-ans" data-sd-ans aria-live="polite"></p> </form> <ul class="sd53-cities" data-reveal><li>Lahore</li><li>Islamabad</li><li>Rawalpindi</li><li>Faisalabad</li><li>Multan</li></ul> <a class="link-gold sd53-more" href="same-day" data-reveal>How same-day works <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a> </div> </div> </section> <div class="sec-seam" aria-hidden="true"></div> <section class="section eco-dark sales-cal" id="sales" aria-label="The WAFA SMART TECH sales calendar"> <div class="wrap wrap-wide"> <div class="rail-head"> <div><span class="eyebrow" data-reveal>The WAFA SMART TECH sales calendar</span><h2 data-reveal>Mark the <em>dates</em></h2></div> <a class="link-gold" href="/#gifts" data-reveal>Eid &amp; gift boxes <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a> </div> <div class="sc-grid sc-3"> <article class="sc-card" data-reveal> <span class="sc-img"><img src="assets/images/v48/sale-1111-sm.webp" alt="" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span> <span cl