"sc-act"><button class="btn btn-gold btn-sm" type="button" data-notify="sale-1212" data-notify-name="WAFA SMART TECH 12.12 Sale"><i class="fa-regular fa-bell" aria-hidden="true"></i> Remind me</button></span> </span> </article> </div> </div> </section> <div class="sec-seam" aria-hidden="true"></div> <section class="section eco-stone" id="houses"> <div class="wrap wrap-wide"> <div class="section-head"> <span class="eyebrow center" data-reveal>The WAFA SMART TECH ecosystem</span> <h2 class="split-words" data-reveal data-split>Eight houses. <em>One standard.</em></h2> <p class="lead" data-reveal>Shop what is live today, and see what arrives next — WAFA SMART TECH launches something new every few days.</p> </div> <div class="houses houses-8"> <a class="house-tile h0 is-live" href="herbal" style="--accent:#2F6B47;--reveal-delay:0ms" data-reveal> <span class="ht-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/eco/life-champi-sm.webp')"><img src="assets/images/eco/life-champi.webp" srcset="assets/images/eco/life-champi-sm.webp 500w, assets/images/eco/life-champi.webp 832w" sizes="(max-width: 860px) 50vw, 33vw" alt="Herbal &amp; Organic" width="832" height="1040" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span></span> <span class="ht-shine" aria-hidden="true"></span> <span class="ht-body"> <span class="ht-top"><i class="fa-solid fa-leaf" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="st st-live">Available now</span></span> <b>Herbal &amp; Organic</b> <small>Cold-pressed botanicals, made in Dubai.</small> <span class="ht-subs"><em class="live">Hair care</em><em class="live">Shampoo &amp; conditioner</em><em class="live">Hair &amp; scalp serums</em><em class="">Men&#039;s grooming</em></span> <span class="ht-go">Shop now <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span> </span> </a> <a class="house-tile h1 is-live" href="shop/garments" style="--accent:#1C1B1F;--reveal-delay:80ms" data-reveal> <span class="ht-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/v55/house-