ass="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span> </span> </a> <a class="house-tile h5 is-launching" href="shop/baby" style="--accent:#7FA38C;--reveal-delay:160ms" data-reveal> <span class="ht-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/eco/life-baby-sm.webp')"><img src="assets/images/eco/life-baby.webp" srcset="assets/images/eco/life-baby-sm.webp 500w, assets/images/eco/life-baby.webp 832w" sizes="(max-width: 860px) 50vw, 33vw" alt="Baby Care" width="832" height="1040" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span></span> <span class="ht-shine" aria-hidden="true"></span> <span class="ht-body"> <span class="ht-top"><i class="fa-solid fa-baby" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="st st-launching">Launching next</span></span> <b>Baby Care</b> <small>The mildest botanicals, for the smallest skin.</small> <span class="ht-subs"><em class="">Lotions, oils &amp; creams</em><em class="">Bath &amp; wash</em><em class="">Diapers &amp; wipes</em><em class="">Baby cotton wear</em></span> <span class="ht-go">Preview the house <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span> </span> </a> <a class="house-tile h6 is-live" href="shop/beauty" style="--accent:#A9786A;--reveal-delay:0ms" data-reveal> <span class="ht-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/v49/white-serum-sm.webp')"><img src="assets/images/v49/white-serum.webp" srcset="assets/images/v49/white-serum-sm.webp 480w, assets/images/v49/white-serum.webp 832w" sizes="(max-width: 860px) 50vw, 33vw" alt="Cosmetics &amp; Beauty" width="832" height="1040" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span></span> <span class="ht-shine" aria-hidden="true"></span> <span class="ht-body"> <span class="ht-top"><i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="st st-live">Available now</span></span> <b>Cosmetics &amp; Beauty</b> <small>Skincare composed in Dubai — serums, creams, sun care and cleansers.</small> <span class="ht-subs"><em class="live">Creams &amp; facials</em><em class="live">Serums</em><em class="live">Sun care</em><em class="live">Cleansers</em></span> <span class="ht-go">Shop now <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span> </span> </a> <a class="house-tile h7 is-soon" href="shop/home" style="--accent:#6F8296;--reveal-delay:80ms" data-reveal> <span class="ht-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/eco/soon-towels-sm.webp')"><img src="assets/images/eco/soon-towels.webp" srcset="assets/images/eco/soon-towels-sm.webp 500w, assets/images/eco/soon-towels.webp 832w" sizes="(max-width: 860px) 50vw, 33vw" alt="Home &amp; Living" width="832" height="1040" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span></span> <span class="ht-shine" aria-hidden="true"></span> <span class="ht-body"> <span class="ht-top"><i class="fa-solid fa-house-chimney" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="st st-soon">Coming soon</span></span> <b>Home &amp; Living</b> <small>Five-star comfort for everyday homes.</small> <span class="ht-subs"><em class="">Towels &amp; linen</em><em class="">Tissues &amp; hygiene</em><em class="">Bath robes &amp; towels</em></span> <span class="ht-go">Preview the house <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span> </span> </a> </div> </div> </section> <div class="sec-seam" aria-hidden="true"></div><section class="estate55" id="estate" aria-label="The House estate"> <div class="e55-media" aria-hidden="true"> <img src="assets/images/v55/estate.webp?v=tnowd9" alt="" width="2048" height="1152" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> <video muted loop playsinline preload="none" data-lazy-poster="assets/images/v55/estate.webp?v=tnowd9" data-scene data-src="assets/videos/eco/v55-estate.mp4?v=tnowez"></video> </div> <div class="e55-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div> <div class="wrap wrap-wide e55-in"> <div class="e55-head"> <span class="eyebrow center" data-reveal>The House estate</span> <h2 data-reveal>One House. <em>Every door open.</em></h2> <p class="lead" data-reveal>Everything the House of WAFA SMART TECH does, in one view — from the houses you shop to the partners, tools and trade that keep them running.</p> </div> <div class="e55-grid"> <a class="e55-door" href="/shop" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:0ms"> <i class="fa-solid fa-building-columns" aria-hidden="true"></i> <b>The houses</b><small>5 houses open · 66 creations</small><span>Herbal, garments, foods, beauty and more — one standard, one checkout.</span> <em>Enter <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></em> </a> <a class="e55-door" href="shop/gifts" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:70ms"> <i class="fa-solid fa-gift" aria-hidden="true"></i> <b>Gifts &amp; privileges</b><small>Gift boxes · same-day in selected cities</small><span>For him, her, Abbu, Ammi and Eid — sealed in black and gold.</span> <em>Enter <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></em> </a> <a class="e55-door" href="tools" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:140ms"> <i class="fa-solid fa-briefcase" aria-hidden="true"></i> <b>WAFA SMART TECH for business</b><small>Meeting Room · 22 free tools · WAFA SMART TECH Codes</small><span>The tools the House runs on, free for everyone.</span> <em>Enter <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></em> </a> <a class="e55-door" href="earn" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:210ms"> <i class="fa-solid fa-handshake" aria-hidden="true"></i> <b>Partners of the House</b><small>BDM · BDO · franchise · dropship · creators · investors</small><span>Grow with the House — every programme with its own portal.</span> <em>Enter <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></em> </a> <a class="e55-door" href="export" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:280ms"> <i class="fa-solid fa-ship" aria-hidden="true"></i> <b>Export &amp; trade</b><small>Importers · distributors · private label</small><span>Bulk supply from Pakistan to the world, documented end to end.</span> <em>Enter <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></em> </a> <a class="e55-door" href="a-z" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:350ms"> <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot" aria-hidden="true"></i> <b>Boutiques &amp; cities</b><small>Dubai head office · 33 cities</small><span>Delivered across Pakistan and the UAE — and the whole House, A to Z.</span> <em>Enter <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></em> </a> </div> </div> </section> <div class="sec-seam" aria-hidden="true"></div><section class="scene55" style="--pos:50% 45%" aria-label="Breakfast, the way it was meant to be"><div class="sc55-bg" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/images/v55/people-breakfast.webp?v=tnowdc" srcset="assets/images/v55/people-breakfast-sm.webp 960w, assets/images/v55/people-breakfast.webp 1920w" sizes="100vw" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="sc55-veil" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wrap wrap-wide sc55-copy" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">The WAFA SMART TECH table</span><h2>Breakfast, <em>the way it was meant to be</em></h2><p>Murabba by the spoon, achaar beside warm parathas, dates and chai — the family table the WAFA SMART TECH pantry is made for.</p><a class="btn btn-gold" href="shop/foods">Visit the pantry <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></div></section> <section class="section eco-light pantry" id="pantry" aria-label="The WAFA SMART TECH pantry"> <div class="wrap wrap-wide"> <div class="rail-head"> <div><span class="eyebrow" data-reveal>The WAFA SMART TECH pantry</span><h2 data-reveal>Heritage foods, <em>made with care</em></h2><p class="lead" data-reveal>Murabbas slow-cooked in small batches, achaar in mustard oil, hand-selected dates and WAFA SMART TECH Fresh fruit in season — packed in the WAFA SMART TECH gift box.</p></div> <a class="link-gold" href="shop/foods" data-reveal>The Foods house <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a> </div> <div class="pantry-grid has-film n-4"> <a class="pantry-film" href="product/aam-ka-murabba" data-reveal> <video muted loop playsinline preload="none" data-lazy-poster="assets/videos/eco/ugc-murabba-toast.webp?v=tnowe4" data-lazy-bg data-src="assets/videos/eco/ugc-murabba-toast.mp4?v=tnowe6" data-ugc aria-label="Murabba on warm toast"></video> <span class="pf-cap"><i class="fa-solid fa-play" aria-hidden="true"></i> Murabba on warm toast<em>Styled film</em></span> </a> <a class="pantry-tile" href="shop/foods/preserves" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:0ms"> <span class="pt-img"><img src="assets/images/v48/mur-box-r-sm.webp?v=tnowca" alt="WAFA SMART TECH Murabba" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span> <span class="pt-body"><b>Murabba</b><small>Mango, apple, bamboo, amla and carrot</small><em>from Rs. 1,350</em></span> </a> <a class="pantry-tile" href="shop/foods/pickles" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:70ms"> <span class="pt-img"><img src="assets/images/v48/achaar-box-sm.webp?v=tnowc3" alt="WAFA SMART TECH Achaar" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span> <span class="pt-body"><b>Achaar</b><small>Mango, mixed and lemon, in mustard oil</small><em>from Rs. 1,450</em></span> </a> <a class="pantry-tile" href="shop/foods/dates" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:140ms"> <span class="pt-img"><img src="assets/images/v48/dates-box-sm.webp?v=tnowc5" alt="WAFA SMART TECH Dates" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span> <span class="pt-body"><b>Dates</b><small>Ajwa, Medjool, Mabroom and Sukkari</small><em>from Rs. 2,450</em></span> </a> <a class="pantry-tile" href="shop/foods/fresh-fruits" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:210ms"> <span class="pt-img"><img src="assets/images/v48/fr-malta-sm.webp?v=tnowc7" alt="WAFA SMART TECH WAFA SMART TECH Fresh" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span> <span class="pt-body"><b>WAFA SMART TECH Fresh</b><small>Winter Malta and bananas, in season</small><em>from Rs. 1,650</em></span> </a> </div> </div> </section> <div class="sec-seam" aria-hidden="true"></div> <section class="section eco-stone" id="sets"> <div class="wrap wrap-wide"> <div class="section-head"> <span class="eyebrow center" data-reveal>Value, the WAFA SMART TECH way</span> <h2 class="split-words" data-reveal data-split>Luxury from <em>Rs. 899</em></h2> <p class="lead" data-reveal>Start small, or gift the full set. Every pack is boxed — and card orders ship free.</p> </div> <div class="edit-rail" data-drag> <a class="edit-card" href="product/pure-cotton-underwear?pack=p1" data-reveal> <span class="ec-img"><img src="assets/images/eco/trunks-box-sm.webp" alt="WAFA SMART TECH Pure Cotton Underwear" loading="lazy" width="416" height="520"></span> <span class="ec-body"><small>Single</small><b>Pure Cotton Underwear</b> <span class="ec-price">Rs. 899 <s>Rs. 1,099</s></span></span> <span class="ec-go" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></span> </a> <a class="edit-card" href="product/pure-cotton-vest?pack=p1" data-reveal> <span class="ec-img"><img src="assets/images/eco/vest-box-sm.webp" alt="WAFA SMART TECH Pure Cotton Vest" loading="lazy" width="416" height="520"></span> <span class="ec-body"><small>Single</small><b>Pure Cotton Vest</b> <span class="ec-price">Rs. 999 <s>Rs. 1,199</s></span></span> <span class="ec-go" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></span> </a> <a class="edit-card" href="product/mens-cotton-socks?pack=p2" data-reveal> <span class="ec-img"><img src="assets/images/eco/socks-men-sm.webp" alt="WAFA SMART TECH Men&#039;s Cotton Socks" loading="lazy" width="416" height="520"></span> <span class="ec-body"><small>2 pairs</small><b>Men&#039;s Cotton Socks</b> <span class="ec-price">Rs. 999 <s>Rs. 1,098</s></span></span> <span class="ec-go" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></span> </a> <a class="edit-card" href="product/womens-cotton-socks?pack=p2" data-reveal> <span class="ec-img"><img src="assets/images/eco/socks-women-sm.webp" alt="WAFA SMART TECH Women&#039;s Cotton Socks" loading="lazy" width="416" height="520"></span> <span class="ec-body"><small>2 pairs</small><b>Women&#039;s Cotton Socks</b> <span class="ec-price">Rs. 999 <s>Rs. 1,098</s></span></span> <span class="ec-go" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid fa-plus"></i></span> </a> </div> <h3 class="sets-h" data-reveal>Hair oil rituals</h3> <div class="bundle-grid oil-grid as-rail" data-rail-auto> <a class="bundle-card" href="/herbal?pack=1#shop" data-reveal> <span class="bc-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/eco/oil-pack-1-sm.webp')"><img src="assets/images/eco/oil-pack-1.webp" srcset="assets/images/eco/oil-pack-1-sm.webp 480w, assets/images/eco/oil-pack-1.webp 832w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 40vw, 14vw" alt="WAFA SMART TECH Organic Hair Oil — The Ritual Starter" width="832" height="1040" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span></span> <span class="bc-body"><b>The WAFA SMART TECH Ritual Starter</b><small>Organic Hair Oil · 1 bottle · 100 ml — cold-pressed onion, kalonji &amp; coconut.</small> <span class="p-price">Rs. 2,299 <s>Rs. 2,999</s> <em>Save Rs. 700</em></span></span> </a> <a class="bundle-card" href="/herbal?pack=2#shop" data-reveal> <span class="bc-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/eco/oil-pack-3-sm.webp')"><img src="assets/images/eco/oil-pack-3.webp" srcset="assets/images/eco/oil-pack-3-sm.webp 480w, assets/images/eco/oil-pack-3.webp 832w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 40vw, 14vw" alt="WAFA SMART TECH Organic Hair Oil — The Twelve-Week Ritual" width="832" height="1040" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><em class="p-badge">Most chosen</em></span> <span class="bc-body"><b>The WAFA SMART TECH Twelve-Week Ritual</b><small>Organic Hair Oil · 3 bottles · 300 ml — cold-pressed onion, kalonji &amp; coconut.</small> <span class="p-price">Rs. 4,999 <s>Rs. 8,997</s> <em>Save Rs. 3,998</em></span></span> </a> <a class="bundle-card" href="/herbal?pack=5#shop" data-reveal> <span class="bc-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/eco/oil-pack-5-sm.webp')"><img src="assets/images/eco/oil-pack-5.webp" srcset="assets/images/eco/oil-pack-5-sm.webp 480w, assets/images/eco/oil-pack-5.webp 832w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 40vw, 14vw" alt="WAFA SMART TECH Organic Hair Oil — The Family Reserve" width="832" height="1040" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><em class="p-badge">Best value</em></span> <span class="bc-body"><b>The WAFA SMART TECH Family Reserve</b><small>Organic Hair Oil · 5 bottles · 500 ml — cold-pressed onion, kalonji &amp; coconut.</small> <span class="p-price">Rs. 9,999 <s>Rs. 15,000</s> <em>Save Rs. 5,001</em></span></span> </a> </div> <h3 class="sets-h" data-reveal>Gift sets &amp; value bundles</h3> <div class="bundle-grid as-rail" data-rail-auto> <a class="bundle-card" href="product/the-eid-mubarak-box" data-reveal> <span class="bc-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/v48/eid-closed-sm.webp')"><img src="assets/images/v48/eid-closed.webp" srcset="assets/images/v48/eid-closed-sm.webp 420w, assets/images/v48/eid-closed.webp 832w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 40vw, 14vw" alt="WAFA SMART TECH The Eid Mubarak Box" width="832" height="1040" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><em class="p-badge">Eid</em></span> <span class="bc-body"><b>The WAFA SMART TECH Eid Mubarak Box</b><small>Murabba, mango achaar, the Radiance Cream and monogram socks — Eid, gift-boxed.</small> <span class="p-price">Rs. 5,990 <s>Rs. 6,898</s> <em>Save Rs. 908</em></span></span> </a> <a class="bundle-card" href="product/the-glow-ritual" data-reveal> <span class="bc-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/v50/glow-ritual-sm.webp')"><img src="assets/images/v50/glow-ritual.webp" srcset="assets/images/v50/glow-ritual-sm.webp 480w, assets/images/v50/glow-ritual.webp 1040w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 40vw, 14vw" alt="WAFA SMART TECH The Glow Ritual" width="1040" height="1300" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><em class="p-badge">Save Rs 810</em></span> <span class="bc-body"><b>