ave Rs. 698</em></span></span> </a> <a class="bundle-card" href="product/the-gift-box-for-ammi" data-reveal> <span class="bc-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/v50/gift-ammi-sm.webp')"><img src="assets/images/v50/gift-ammi.webp" srcset="assets/images/v50/gift-ammi-sm.webp 480w, assets/images/v50/gift-ammi.webp 832w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 40vw, 14vw" alt="WAFA SMART TECH The Gift Box for Ammi" width="832" height="1040" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><em class="p-badge">Gift</em></span> <span class="bc-body"><b>The WAFA SMART TECH Gift Box for Ammi</b><small>A Shahkaar embroidered winter suit, Aam ka Murabba and the Radiance Cream.</small> <span class="p-price">Rs. 11,990 <s>Rs. 13,399</s> <em>Save Rs. 1,409</em></span></span> </a> <a class="bundle-card" href="product/the-essentials-kit" data-reveal> <span class="bc-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/eco/essentials-kit-sm.webp')"><img src="assets/images/eco/essentials-kit.webp" srcset="assets/images/eco/essentials-kit-sm.webp 480w, assets/images/eco/essentials-kit.webp 832w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 40vw, 14vw" alt="WAFA SMART TECH The Essentials Kit" width="832" height="1040" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><em class="p-badge">Gift set</em></span> <span class="bc-body"><b>The WAFA SMART TECH Essentials Kit</b><small>3 vests, 3 briefs or trunks and 3 pairs of socks in the WAFA SMART TECH magnetic gift box.</small> <span class="p-price">Rs. 4,999 <s>Rs. 5,497</s> <em>Save Rs. 498</em></span></span> </a> <a class="bundle-card" href="product/the-gift-box-for-my-sister" data-reveal> <span class="bc-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/v50/gift-sister-sm.webp')"><img src="assets/images/v50/gift-sister.webp" srcset="assets/images/v50/gift-sister-sm.webp 480w, assets/images/v50/gift-sister.webp 832w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 40vw, 14vw" alt="WAFA SMART TECH The Gift Box for My Sister" width="832" height="1040" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></spa