d fa-play" aria-hidden="true"></i> Garden to glass</span> </a> <a class="ugc-card" style="--pf:url('assets/images/v3/film-hair.webp?v=tnowbj')" href="/herbal#shop"> <video muted loop playsinline preload="none" data-lazy-poster="assets/images/v3/film-hair.webp?v=tnowbj" data-lazy-bg data-src="assets/videos/v3/film-hair.mp4?v=tnowfz" data-ugc></video> <span class="ugc-cap"><i class="fa-solid fa-play" aria-hidden="true"></i> The finish — soft and glossy</span> </a> <a class="ugc-card" style="--pf:url('assets/images/v3/film-coconut.webp?v=tnowbj')" href="/herbal#shop"> <video muted loop playsinline preload="none" data-lazy-poster="assets/images/v3/film-coconut.webp?v=tnowbj" data-lazy-bg data-src="assets/videos/v3/film-coconut.mp4?v=tnowfz" data-ugc></video> <span class="ugc-cap"><i class="fa-solid fa-play" aria-hidden="true"></i> Virgin coconut, the carrier</span> </a> <a class="ugc-card" style="--pf:url('assets/images/v3/film-aloe.webp?v=tnowbi')" href="/herbal#shop"> <video muted loop playsinline preload="none" data-lazy-poster="assets/images/v3/film-aloe.webp?v=tnowbi" data-lazy-bg data-src="assets/videos/v3/film-aloe.mp4?v=tnowfy" data-ugc></video> <span class="ugc-cap"><i class="fa-solid fa-play" aria-hidden="true"></i> Aloe &amp; onion</span> </a> </div> <p class="ugc-note" data-reveal>Styled House films, made with the real WAFA SMART TECH packaging — not customer testimonials.</p> </div> </section> <div class="sec-seam" aria-hidden="true"></div> <section class="section eco-dark eco-trust" id="trust"> <div class="wrap wrap-wide"> <div class="trust-top"> <div data-reveal> <span class="eyebrow">What customers say</span> <h2>Trusted by <em>the people who buy it</em></h2> <p class="lead">Every review here was written by a real customer. We publish the critical ones too.</p> </div> <div class="trust-badges" data-reveal> <button type="button" class="tb" data-rvw-open><span class="tb-stars">★★★★★</span><b>4.6/5</b><small>2998 WAFA SMART TECH reviews</small></button> </div> </div> <div class="rv-loop moving" aria-label="Customer reviews"> <div class="rv-track"> <figure class="rv-card"> <span class="rv-stars">★★★★★<i></i></span> <b>The Best Concept i see</b> <blockquote>The luxury stuff and concept looks like</blockquote> <figcaption>Saif · Dubai <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check" title="Verified purchase"></i></figcaption> </figure> <figure class="rv-card"> <span class="rv-stars">★★★★★<i></i></span> <b>Good option for weekly oiling</b> <blockquote>I ordered this for regular scalp and hair oiling and it gives my hair a healthylooking shine without feeling too sticky</blockquote> <figcaption>Nimra S · Rawalpindi <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check" title="Verified purchase"></i></figcaption> </figure> <figure class="rv-card"> <span class="rv-stars">★★★★★<i></i></span> <b>Works well for my routine</b> <blockquote>I ordered this for regular scalp and hair oiling and I have noticed less frizz when I style my hair The coconut oil, mustard oil, kalonji and onionextract blend is a nice combination The presentation looks professional …</blockquote> <figcaption>Anaya M · Sialkot</figcaption> </figure> <figure class="rv-card"> <span class="rv-stars">★★★★<i>★</i></span> <b>Feels nourishing</b> <blockquote>I added WAFA SMART TECH Organic Hair Oil to my weekly haircare routine and my hair feels nourished after each use</blockquote> <figcaption>Sadia E · Jhelum</figcaption> </figure> <figure class="rv-card"> <span class="rv-stars">★★★★★<i></i></span> <b>Lovely shine after use</b> <blockquote>I tried WAFA SMART TECH hair oil after seeing the ingredient blend and I like the smooth feel it leaves after washing I like the product experience overall</blockquote> <figcaption>Faizan I · Gujrat</figcaption> </figure> <figure class="rv-card"> <span class="rv-stars">★★★★★<i></i></span> <b>Good option for weekly oiling</b> <blockquote>I bought it mainly because I wanted a herbal oil blend and I like how manageable my hair feels afterward The herbal oil blend feels thoughtfully put together</blockquote> <figcaption>Ahsan Q · Sialkot</figcaption> </figure> <figure class="rv-card"> <span class="rv-stars">★★★★★<i></i></span> <b>Smooth and manageable hair</b> <blockquote>I started using the WAFA SMART TECH oil before wash days and it has made my prewash routine much easier The bottle is easy to keep in my haircare shelf I like the product experience overall</blockquote> <figcaption>Ahsan I · Karachi</figcaption> </figure> <figure class="rv-card"> <span class="rv-stars">★★<i>★★★</i></span> <b>Delivery could be faster</b> <blockquote>Delivery took longer than I expected The product was sealed correctly when it arrived</blockquote> <figcaption>Fahad P · Multan</figcaption> </figure> <figure class="rv-card"> <span class="rv-stars">★★★★★<i></i></span> <b>Works well for my routine</b> <blockquote>I tested this oil as part of my normal hair routine and it works nicely for a gentle scalp massage I especially liked seeing coconut oil and kalonji in the ingredient blend For me, it has been a convenient weekly hair o…</blockquote> <figcaption>Rida G · Faisalabad</figcaption> </figure> <figure class="rv-card"> <span class="rv-stars">★★★★<i>★</i></span> <b>Good for dry hair</b> <blockquote>I tried WAFA SMART TECH hair oil after seeing the ingredient blend and I have noticed less frizz when I style my hair</blockquote> <figcaption>Fatima F · Sargodha</figcaption> </figure> <figure class="rv-card"> <span class="rv-stars">★★★★★<i></i></span> <b>Good first impression</b> <blockquote>I ordered this for regular scalp and hair oiling and my dry ends feel more conditioned The packaging made a strong first impression I like the product experience overall</blockquote> <figcaption>Talha M · Sargodha</figcaption> </figure> <figure class="rv-card"> <span class="rv-stars">★★<i>★★★</i></span> <b>Delivery could be faster</b> <blockquote>The product itself was usable, but the oil felt heavier than I prefer Using a smaller amount worked better for me</b