</a> <a class="grow-card" href="/careers#roles" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:70ms"><span class="gc-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/v46/boutique-abudhabi-lounge-sm.webp')"><img src="assets/images/v46/boutique-abudhabi-lounge.webp" srcset="assets/images/v46/boutique-abudhabi-lounge-sm.webp 800w, assets/images/v46/boutique-abudhabi-lounge.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 48vw, 25vw" alt="An WAFA SMART TECH Business Development Officer in a one-to-one consultation" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span></span> <span><i class="fa-solid fa-people-group" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Business Development Officer</b><small>Join a BDM's team or work independently, with your own code and WAFA SMART TECH ID card</small></span></a> <a class="grow-card" href="/earn#franchise" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:140ms"><span class="gc-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/v3/outlet-sharjah.webp')"><img src="assets/images/v3/outlet-sharjah.webp" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 48vw, 25vw" alt="An WAFA SMART TECH franchise kiosk in a shopping mall" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span></span> <span><i class="fa-solid fa-shop" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Franchise</b><small>Open an WAFA SMART TECH boutique or kiosk in your city, with the House behind you</small></span></a> <a class="grow-card" href="/earn#b2b" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:210ms"><span class="gc-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/eco/banner-retail-sm.webp')"><img src="assets/images/eco/banner-retail.webp" srcset="assets/images/eco/banner-retail-sm.webp 800w, assets/images/eco/banner-retail.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 48vw, 25vw" alt="A shop owner stocking WAFA SMART TECH products on his shelves" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span></span> <span><i class="fa-solid fa-boxes-stacked" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Wholesale &amp; B2B</b><small>Up to 25%+ off retail for shops, pharmacies &amp; distributors</small></span></a> <a class="grow-card" href="/earn#dropship" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:0ms"><span class="gc-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/eco/banner-dropship-sm.webp')"><img src="assets/images/eco/banner-dropship.webp" srcset="assets/images/eco/banner-dropship-sm.webp 800w, assets/images/eco/banner-dropship.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 48vw, 25vw" alt="Two young founders running their online store at night" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span></span> <span><i class="fa-solid fa-store" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Dropshipping</b><small>Import our listings, set your price — we deliver, you keep the profit</small></span></a> <a class="grow-card" href="/earn#ambassador" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:70ms"><span class="gc-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/eco/ugc-socks-sm.webp')"><img src="assets/images/eco/ugc-socks.webp" srcset="assets/images/eco/ugc-socks-sm.webp 480w, assets/images/eco/ugc-socks.webp 720w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 48vw, 25vw" alt="An WAFA SMART TECH creator filming a reel" width="720" height="1280" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span></span> <span><i class="fa-solid fa-star" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Creators &amp; ambassadors</b><small>10% commission with your own discount code</small></span></a> <a class="grow-card" href="/earn#investor" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:140ms"><span class="gc-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/eco/banner-investors-sm.webp')"><img src="assets/images/eco/banner-investors.webp" srcset="assets/images/eco/banner-investors-sm.webp 800w, assets/images/eco/banner-investors.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 48vw, 25vw" alt="WAFA SMART TECH investors meeting in a Dubai boardroom" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span></span> <span><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Investors</b><small>Private investor accounts with reports on the House</small></span></a> <a class="grow-card" href="/export" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:210ms"><span class="gc-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/v48/export-dock-sm.webp')"><img src="assets/images/v48/export-dock.webp" srcset="assets/images/v48/export-dock-sm.webp 640w, assets/images/v48/export-dock.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 48vw, 25vw" alt="WAFA SMART TECH cartons on pallets at an export dock at sunset" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span></span> <span><i class="fa-solid fa-ship" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>Export &amp; trade</b><small>Importers and distributors worldwide — volume prices and full shipping documents</small></span></a> </div> </div> </section> <div class="sec-seam" aria-hidden="true"></div> <section class="section eco-stone biz-band" id="business" aria-label="WAFA SMART TECH for business"> <div class="wrap wrap-wide"> <div class="rail-head"> <div><span class="eyebrow" data-reveal>WAFA SMART TECH for business · free to use</span><h2 data-reveal>The House <em>at work</em></h2> <p class="lead" data-reveal>The tools the House runs on, open to everyone — no sign-up needed. Keep your meetings, codes and invoices in your House account if you like.</p></div> <a class="btn btn-dark" href="tools" data-reveal><i class="fa-solid fa-toolbox" aria-hidden="true"></i> All free tools</a> </div> <div class="biz-band-grid"> <a class="bb-card bb-meet" href="meet" data-reveal> <span class="bb-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/v53/meet-sm.webp')"><img src="assets/images/v53/meet.webp" srcset="assets/images/v53/meet-sm.webp 960w, assets/images/v53/meet.webp 1920w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 50vw" alt="The House of WAFA SMART TECH Meeting Room" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span></span> <span class="bb-body"><i class="fa-solid fa-video" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>The Meeting Room</b><small>HD video meetings in the browser — invite by link, share your screen, record. Nothing to install.</small><em>Start a meeting <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></em></span> </a> <a class="bb-card" href="tools" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:80ms"> <span class="bb-body"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-pdf" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>PDF &amp; file tools</b><small>Merge, split, compress, sign, number and convert PDFs; images, ZIP files and more — right on your device.</small><em>Open the tools <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></em></span> </a> <a class="bb-card" href="tools/qr" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:160ms"> <span class="bb-body"><i class="fa-solid fa-qrcode" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>QR codes &amp; invoices</b><small>Branded QR codes, barcodes and professional invoices — free, and saved to your account when you sign in.</small><em>Make a QR code <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></em></span> </a> <a class="bb-card bb-gold" href="codes" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:240ms"> <span class="bb-body"><i class="fa-solid fa-barcode" aria-hidden="true"></i><b>WAFA SMART TECH Codes</b><small>Barcode artwork, carton labels, dynamic QR and SKU systems, done for you by the House.</small><em>See the services <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></em></span> </a> </div> </div> </section> <div class="sec-seam" aria-hidden="true"></div> <section class="section eco-emerald export-band" id="export" aria-label="WAFA SMART TECH Export & Trade"> <div class="wrap wrap-wide xb-grid"> <a class="xb-media" href="export" data-reveal> <video muted loop playsinline preload="none" data-lazy-poster="assets/videos/eco/export-dock.webp?v=tnowdm" data-lazy-bg data-src="assets/videos/eco/export-dock.mp4?v=tnowdo" data-ugc aria-label="WAFA SMART TECH Export &amp; Trade"></video><em class="xb-tag">Styled film</em> </a> <div class="xb-copy"> <span class="eyebrow" data-reveal>WAFA SMART TECH Export &amp; Trade</span> <h2 data-reveal>Made in Pakistan, <em>shipped to the world</em></h2> <p class="lead" data-reveal>Importers, distributors, FMCG and trading companies: buy WAFA SMART TECH foods, garments and care in bulk at special import prices, with export documents prepared for your market.</p> <ul class="xb-points" data-reveal> <li><i class="fa-solid fa-boxes-stacked" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>Bulk by carton, pallet or container</b>Foods, garments, care and gift boxes</span></li> <li><i class="fa-solid fa-file-contract" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>Export documents prepared</b>Invoice, packing list and certificate of origin</span></li> <li><i class="fa-solid fa-ship" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>EXW, FOB Karachi or delivered</b>Sea and air freight, quoted per shipment</span></li> <li><i class="fa-solid fa-percent" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>Special import prices</b>Tiered by volume for licensed importers</span></li> </ul> <div class="eh-cta" data-reveal><a class="btn btn-gold btn-lg" href="export#rfq"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-signature" aria-hidden="true"></i> Request an export quote</a><a class="btn btn-ghost on-dark btn-lg" href="export">Export &amp; trade</a></div> </div> </div> </section> <div class="sec-seam" aria-hidden="true"></div> <section class="scene55" style="--pos:55% 35%" aria-label="Received like family"><div class="sc55-bg" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/images/v55/people-boutique.webp?v=tnowdb" srcset="assets/images/v55/people-boutique-sm.webp 960w, assets/images/v55/people-boutique.webp 1920w" sizes="100vw" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="sc55-veil" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="wrap wrap-wide sc55-copy" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">Visit the House</span><h2>Received <em>like family</em></h2><p>The WAFA SMART TECH head office in Dubai is open — come and see the pieces, the boxes and the routine in person.</p><a class="btn btn-gold" href="/#boutiques">Find the House <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></div></section><section class="section eco-stone boutiques-sec" id="boutiques"> <div class="wrap wrap-wide"> <div class="section-head"> <span class="eyebrow center" data-reveal>The WAFA SMART TECH boutiques</span> <h2 class="split-words" data-reveal data-split>Visit the House, <em>in person</em></h2> <p class="lead" data-reveal>The whole House under one roof — herbal hair and body care, pure cotton garments, clean cosmetics and gentle baby care. Our Dubai and Abu Dhabi boutiques are open; Sharjah is next, then Pakistan.</p> <p class="office-open" data-reveal><i class="fa-solid fa-building" aria-hidden="true"></i> <b>The WAFA SMART TECH head office in Dubai is now open</b> — Meydan Free Zone, Meydan Grandstand, 6th Floor, Nad Al Sheba, Dubai, UAE</p> </div> <div class="bq-films n-4" aria-label="Inside the WAFA SMART TECH boutiques"> <figure class="bq-film lead" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:0ms"> <video muted loop playsinline preload="none" data-lazy-poster="assets/videos/eco/house-boutique-hall.webp?v=tnowdo" data-lazy-bg data-src="assets/videos/eco/house-boutique-hall.mp4?v=tnowdt" data-ugc aria-label="Inside the WAFA SMART TECH boutique, Dubai"></video> <figcaption><span>Inside the WAFA SMART TECH boutique, Dubai</span><em>Styled film</em></figcaption> </figure> <figure class="bq-film" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:70ms"> <video muted loop playsinline preload="none" data-lazy-poster="assets/videos/eco/house-boutique-suits.webp?v=tnowdp" data-lazy-bg data-src="assets/videos/eco/house-boutique-suits.mp4?v=tnowds" data-ugc aria-label="The Winter &#039;26 embroidery, unfolded"></video> <figcaption><span>The Winter &#039;26 embroidery, unfolded</span><em>Styled film</em></figcaption> </figure> <figure class="bq-film" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:140ms"> <video muted loop playsinline preload="none" data-lazy-poster="assets/videos/eco/house-boutique-wrap.webp?v=tnowdp" data-lazy-bg data-src="assets/videos/eco/house-boutique-wrap.mp4?v=tnowdr" data-ugc aria-label="Wrapped by hand at the counter"></video> <figcaption><span>Wrapped by hand at the counter</span><em>Styled film</em></figcaption> </figure> <figure class="bq-film" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:210ms"> <video muted loop playsinline preload="none" data-lazy-poster="assets/videos/eco/house-boutique-evening.webp?v=tnowdn" data-lazy-bg data-src="assets/videos/eco/house-boutique-evening.mp4?v=tnowdq" data-ugc aria-label="Evening at the Dubai boutique"></video> <figcaption><span>Evening at the Dubai boutique</span><em>Styled film</em></figcaption> </figure> </div> <div class="bq-grid"> <article class="bq-card" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:0ms"> <span class="bq-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/v3/outlet-dubai.webp')"><img src="assets/images/v3/outlet-dubai.webp" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 90vw, 33vw" alt="Design concept for the WAFA SMART TECH boutique in Dubai" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><em class="bq-tag">Design concept</em></span> <span class="bq-body"> <span class="outlet-flag open"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i> Open</span> <b>Dubai</b> <small>The WAFA SMART TECH flagship boutique — now open</small> <small class="bq-note">Herbal hair care, cosmetics and baby care under one roof.</small> <a class="link-gold" href="https://wa.me/9232466627054?text=Hello%20WAFA SMART TECH%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20visit%20the%20Dubai%20boutique.%20Where%20do%20I%20find%20you%3F" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp" aria-hidden="true"></i> Plan your visit</a> </span> </article> <article class="bq-card" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:80ms"> <span class="bq-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/v3/outlet-abudhabi.webp')"><img src="assets/images/v3/outlet-abudhabi.webp" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 90vw, 33vw" alt="Design concept for the WAFA SMART TECH boutique in Abu Dhabi" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><em class="bq-tag">Design concept</em></span> <span class="bq-body"> <span class="outlet-flag open"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i> Open</span> <b>Abu Dhabi</b> <small>The WAFA SMART TECH boutique and consultation lounge — now open</small> <small class="bq-note">Try every WAFA SMART TECH product with a beauty advisor.</small> <a class="link-gold" href="https://wa.me/9232466627054?text=Hello%20WAFA SMART TECH%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20visit%20the%20Abu%20Dhabi%20boutique.%20Where%20do%20I%20find%20you%3F" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp" aria-hidden="true"></i> Plan your visit</a> </span> </article> <article class="bq-card" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:160ms"> <span class="bq-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/v3/outlet-sharjah.webp')"><img src="assets/images/v3/outlet-sharjah.webp" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 90vw, 33vw" alt="Design concept for the WAFA SMART TECH boutique in Sharjah" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><em class="bq-tag">Design concept</em></span> <span class="bq-body"> <span class="outlet-flag soon">Opening soon</span> <b>Sharjah</b> <small>An island boutique in a Sharjah mall</small> <small class="bq-note">The full WAFA SMART TECH range, with same-day pick-up of online orders.</small> <a class="link-gold" href="https://wa.me/9232466627054?text=Hello%20WAFA SMART TECH%2C%20please%20tell%20me%20when%20the%20Sharjah%20boutique%20opens." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp" aria-hidden="true"></i> Tell me when it opens</a> </span> </article> </div> </div> </section> <div class="sec-seam" aria-hidden="true"></div> <section class="section eco-light" id="journal"> <div class="wrap wrap-wide"> <div class="rail-head"> <div><span class="eyebrow" data-reveal>The WAFA SMART TECH Journal</span><h2 data-reveal>Read, learn, <em>live well</em></h2></div> <a class="link-gold" href="journal" data-reveal>All stories <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a> </div> <div class="journal-grid"> <a class="j-card" href="journal/onion-hair-oil-price-in-pakistan" data-reveal> <span class="j-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/v3/ing-onion.webp')"><img src="assets/images/v3/ing-onion.webp" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 80vw, 30vw" alt="" width="900" height="1200" fetchpriority="high"></span></span> <span class="j-body"><small>Hair &amp; herbal care</small><b>Onion Hair Oil Price in Pakistan: What You Are Really Paying For</b><span>Onion hair oil in Pakistan ranges from Rs. 400 to over Rs. 2,000. Here is how to tell a real cold-pressed blend from mineral oil with an onion label.</span></span> </a> <a class="j-card" href="journal/how-to-use-onion-hair-oil" data-reveal> <span class="j-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/v3/life-ritual.webp')"><img src="assets/images/v3/life-ritual.webp" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 80vw, 30vw" alt="" width="1100" height="1467" fetchpriority="high"></span></span> <span class="j-body"><small>Hair &amp; herbal care</small><b>How to Use Onion Hair Oil: The Four-Minute Routine</b><span>A step-by-step onion hair oil routine — how much to use, how long to leave it, how often, and how to wash it out without stripping your hair.</span></span> </a> <a class="j-card" href="journal/kalonji-oil-for-hair" data-reveal> <span class="j-img"><span class="fit" style="--fit:url('assets/images/v3/ing-kalonji.webp')"><img src="assets/images/v3/ing-kalonji.webp" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 80vw, 30vw" alt="" width="900" height="1200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span></span> <span class="j-body"><small>Hair &amp; herbal care</small><b>Kalonji Oil for Hair: What Black Seed Brings to a Hair Oil</b><span>Kalonji (black seed, Nigella sativa) has been used across Pakistan for generations. Here is what it contributes to a hair oil blend and how to use it.</span></span> </a> </div> </div> </section> <div class="sec-seam" aria-hidden="true"></div> <section class="section eco-dark finale eco-finale" id="join"> <div class="wrap"> <span class="eyebrow center" data-reveal>The WAFA SMART TECH Circle</span> <h2 class="split-words" data-reveal data-split>Everyday life, <em>made luxurious</em></h2> <p class="lead" data-reveal>Launch alerts, members-only offers and first access to every new house. One email when it matters.</p> <div class="news-band" data-reveal> <form class="news-form" data-form="subscribe" novalidate> <label class="sr-only" for="newsEmail">Email address</label> <input id="newsEmail" type="email" name="email" placeholder="your@email.com" required autocomplete="email"> <input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px;"> <button class="btn btn-gold" type="submit"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope-open-text" aria-hidden="true"></i> Join the Circle</button> <label class="consent" style="flex-basis:100%;"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="1"><span>Yes, email me launches and offers. I can unsubscribe in one click, and I have read the <a href="/page/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</span></label> </form> <p class="form-msg" data-form-msg="subscribe" aria-live="polite"></p> </div> </div> </section> </main> <script>(function(){var h=location.hash.replace('#','');if(/^(shop|botanicals|ritual|reviews|reviews-list|films|faq|house|boutiques|top)$/.test(h)){location.replace('herbal.php#'+h);}})();</script> <footer class="footer"> <div class="ft-promise"> <div class="wrap wrap-wide ft-promise-grid"> <div class="ft-p"><i class="fa-solid fa-truck-fast" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>Free delivery</b><small>when you pay by card</small></span></div> <div class="ft-p"><i class="fa-solid fa-hand-holding-dollar" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>Cash on delivery</b><small>pay at your door</small></span></div> <div class="ft-p"><i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>14-day returns</b><small>on unopened items</small></span></div> <div class="ft-p"><i class="fa-solid fa-gift" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>The WAFA SMART TECH box</b><small>every order, gift-ready</small></span></div> <div class="ft-p"><i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>Real people</b><small>on WhatsApp, every day</small></span></div> </div> </div> <div class="wrap wrap-wide"> <div class="ft-head"> <div class="footer-brand"> <a class="ft-crest" href="/" aria-label="The House of WAFA SMART TECH — established 2009"> <span class="ft-crest-ring" aria-hidden="true"><img src="assets/images/sfiva-logo.svg" alt="" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy"></span> <span class="ft-crest-text"> <span class="ft-crest-house">The House of</span> <span class="ft-crest-word">WAFA SMART TECH<sup class="tm">™</sup></span> <span class="ft-crest-est"><i aria-hidden="true"></i>Est. 2009<i aria-hidden="true"></i></span> </span> </a> <p class="footer-note"> The House of WAFA SMART TECH<sup class="tm">™</sup> — a Dubai-born FMCG &amp; lifestyle house. Herbal care, pure cotton garments, heritage foods, fragrance and baby care, delivered across Pakistan, the UAE and beyond. Retail, wholesale and dropshipping. </p> <div class="socials"> <a href="https://instagram.com/sfivallc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Instagram"> <i class="fa-brands fa-instagram" aria-hidden="true"></i> </a> <a href="https://facebook.com/sfivallc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Facebook"> <i class="fa-brands fa-facebook-f" aria-hidden="true"></i> </a> <a href="https://tiktok.com/@sfivallc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="TikTok"> <i class="fa-brands fa-tiktok" aria-hidden="true"></i> </a> <a href="https://youtube.com/@sfivallc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="YouTube"> <i class="fa-brands fa-youtube" aria-hidden="true"></i> </a> <a href="https://snapchat.com/add/sfivallc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" ari