g aria-live="polite"></p> </details> <div class="field ref-field" data-ref-field> <label class="ref-tick"><input type="checkbox" name="ref_on" value="1" data-ref-tick> <span>Referred by a WAFA SMART TECH advisor? <small>Tick to add their code</small></span></label> <div class="ref-row" data-ref-row hidden><input name="ref_code" type="text" placeholder="Advisor code, e.g. BDM-LAH123" autocapitalize="characters" autocomplete="off" maxlength="24" aria-label="Advisor code" data-ref-code enterkeyhint="next"><small class="coupon-msg" data-ref-msg aria-live="polite"></small></div> </div> <div class="pay-options"> <label class="pay-option"><input type="radio" name="payment_method" value="stripe" checked><span><b>Card, Apple Pay or Google Pay</b><small>Secure checkout by Stripe.</small></span><span class="pay-flag free">Free delivery</span></label> <label class="pay-option"><input type="radio" name="payment_method" value="cod"><span><b>Cash on delivery</b><small>Pay the courier at your door.</small></span><span class="pay-flag fee" data-co-codfee>+ delivery</span></label> </div> <p class="co-advance" data-co-advance hidden></p> <div class="field"><label for="bcNotes">Delivery notes <span class="opt">(optional)</span></label><input id="bcNotes" name="notes" type="text" maxlength="400" placeholder="Best time to call, landmark…" enterkeyhint="done"></div> <input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px;"> <button class="btn btn-gold btn-block btn-lg" type="submit" data-bag-submit><i class="fa-solid fa-lock" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span data-bag-submit-label>Place order</span></button> <p class="secure-note"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved" aria-hidden="true"></i> Encrypted checkout · 14-day returns on unopened items · <a class="link-gold" href="/page/terms">Terms</a></p> </form> <div class="modal-body co-done" data-bag-done hidden> <div class="co-tick"><i class="fa-solid fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i></div> <h4>Thank you, <span data-done-name>friend</span>.</h4> <p class="lead">Your order <b data-done-id>—</b> is placed. <span data-done-note></span></p> <p class="co-acct" data-done-acct hidden></p> <div class="success-qr" data-done-qr hidden></div> <div class="co-done-actions"> <a class="btn btn-gold btn-sm" data-done-track href="/track"><i class="fa-solid fa-location-crosshairs" aria-hidden="true"></i> Track it</a> <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" data-done-slip href="/#" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-arrow-down" aria-hidden="true"></i> Order slip</a> <a class="btn btn-wa btn-sm" data-done-wa href="/#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp" aria-hidden="true"></i> Updates on WhatsApp</a> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="modal eco-search" id="searchModal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Search"> <div class="modal-card"> <div class="search-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass" aria-hidden="true"></i><input type="search" data-search-input placeholder="Search vests, socks, hair oil, murabba…" aria-label="Search the store" autocomplete="off"><button class="modal-close" type="button" data-close-modal aria-label="Close search"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></div> <div class="search-results" data-search-results></div> </div> </div> <div class="modal" id="notifyModal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="notifyTitle"> <div class="modal-card" style="max-width:460px;"> <div class="modal-head"><h3 id="notifyTitle">Be first to <em>know</em></h3><button class="modal-close" type="button" data-close-modal aria-label="Close"><i class="fa-solid fa-xmark" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></div> <form class="modal-body" data-notify-form novalidate> <p class="lead" data-notify-name style="margin-bottom:1rem;">We launch something new every few days.</p> <input type="hidden" name="pid"> <div class="field"><label for="nfEmail">Email <span class="opt"