 a printed peach dupatta — ten colours, from jade to lime.","live"],["Shabtaab · SF-141","product/shabtaab-embroidered-dhanak-suit-sf-141","assets/images/v51/suits/shabtaab-red.webp","Dyed dhanak with an embroidered front and sleeves, and a heavily embroidered dupatta — six jewel colours.","live"],["Abshar · SF-142","product/abshar-embroidered-dhanak-suit-sf-142","assets/images/v51/suits/abshar-sand.webp","A dyed dhanak embroidered shirt with a lace-edged dupatta in the same fabric — six colours from sand to orange.","live"],["Yaqoot · SF-143","product/yaqoot-embroidered-dhanak-suit-sf-143","assets/images/v51/suits/yaqoot-coffee.webp","Fancy dhanak embroidered on the front, sleeves and back, with a heavy four-border dupatta — six deep colours.","live"],["Darbar · SF-144","product/darbar-velvet-chamki-suit-sf-144","assets/images/v51/suits/darbar-beige.webp","Velvet chamki dhanak embroidered on the front, sleeves and back, with a heavily embroidered dupatta — six soft colours.","live"],["Firoza · SF-145","product/firoza-embroidered-dhanak-suit-sf-145","assets/images/v51/suits/firoza-teal.webp","Dyed dhanak with a bold embroidered front and sleeves, and a heavily embroidered dupatta — six jewel colours.","live"],["Zumurrud · SF-146","product/zumurrud-embroidered-dhanak-suit-sf-146","assets/images/v51/suits/zumurrud-olive.webp","Fancy dhanak embroidered on the front, back and sleeves, with a heavy four-border dupatta — six colours.","live"],["The Glow Ritual","product/the-glow-ritual","assets/images/v50/glow-ritual.webp","The full WAFA SMART TECH routine in one box: Face Wash, Whitening Serum, Skin Whitening Cream and Sunscreen Gel SPF 60.","live"],["Pure Cotton Vest","product/pure-cotton-vest","assets/images/eco/vest-box.webp","The banyan, perfected: 100% combed-cotton rib-knit that breathes through Pakistan's summer.","live"],["Herbal Shampoo","product/herbal-shampoo","assets/images/eco/hair-shampoo.webp","A sulphate-free herbal shampoo with red onion, kalonji and rosemary, cleansing the gentle way with reetha, shikakai and plant-derived foam. 250 ml.","live"],["Kehkashan · SF-130","product/kehkashan-embroidered-dhanak-suit-sf-130","assets/images/v48/suits/kehkashan-rose.webp","Shimmer dhanak with an embroidered yoke and sleeves, and a shawl edged in embroidered lace — six winter colours.","live"],["The Gift Box for Him","product/the-gift-box-for-him","assets/images/v48b/gift-him.webp","Two combed-cotton vests, a pair of trunks and three pairs of monogram socks.","live"],["Whitening Serum","product/whitening-serum","assets/images/v49/white-serum.webp","Hyaluronic acid 2% and niacinamide 1% in a light, fast-absorbing serum for a brighter, more even-looking complexion. 30 ml.","live"],["Pure Cotton Underwear","product/pure-cotton-underwear","assets/images/eco/trunks-box.webp","Briefs or trunks in soft stretch cotton, with the WAFA SMART TECH gold-woven waistband.","live"],["Herbal Conditioner","product/herbal-conditioner","assets/images/eco/hair-conditioner.webp","A light herbal conditioner with aloe vera, shea butter and amla that detangles and softens without weighing hair down. 200 ml.","live"],["Shahkaar · SF-131","product/shahkaar-embroidered-dhanak-suit-sf-131","assets/images/v48/suits/shahkaar-black.webp","Embroidered front, sleeves and back, with a heavily embroidered four-border dupatta — six deep winter colours.","live"],["The Winter Gift Box for Her","product/the-winter-gift-box-for-her","assets/images/v50/gift-her.webp","A Marjaan embroidered winter suit and the Herbal Radiance Cream.","live"],["Wash & Wear Men's Suit","product/mens-washwear-suit","assets/images/v52/men/fabric-washwear.webp","Easy care, all day — the everyday cloth. It sheds creases, dries quickly and keeps a clean line from the office to the evening. Jet Black, Pure White or Steel Grey; 4.5 m unstitched or stitched by WAFA SMART TECH.","live"],["Cotton Men's Suit","product/mens-cotton-suit","assets/images/v52/men/fabric-cotton.webp","Breathes in the heat — soft, cool and breathable — the cloth for long summer days, Jummah and every warm evening. Jet Black, Pure White or Steel Grey; 4.5 m unstitched or stitched by WAFA SMART TECH.","live"],["Latha Men's Suit","product/mens-latha-suit","assets/images/v52/men/fabric-latha.webp","Crisp and formal — a fine, smooth cloth with a crisp hand that holds a sharp crease — the formal summer white. Jet Black, Pure White or Steel Grey; 4.5 m unstitched or stitched by WAFA SMART TECH.","live"],["Karandi Men's Suit","product/mens-karandi-suit","assets/images/v52/men/fabric-karandi.webp","Texture and warmth — a slubbed, textured weave with body and warmth — made for winter evenings and weddings. Jet Black, Pure White or Steel Grey; 4.5 m unstitched or stitched by WAFA SMART TECH.","live"],["Boski Men's Suit","product/mens-boski-suit","assets/images/v52/men/fabric-boski.webp","The cloth of occasions — soft, fluid and lustrous — boski catches the light with every movement. The cloth of nikahs and Eid. Jet Black, Pure White or Steel Grey; 4.5 m unstitched or stitched by WAFA SMART TECH.","live"],["Skin Whitening Cream","product/skin-whitening-cream","assets/images/v49/white-cream.webp","A rich yet light day-and-night cream for a brighter, more even-looking complexion, in a frosted glass jar with a gold lid. 50 g.","live"],["Men's Cotton Socks","product/mens-cotton-socks","assets/images/eco/socks-men.webp","Three designs — classic rib, SF monogram and cushioned ankle — in soft combed cotton.","live"],["Hair & Scalp Serum","product/hair-and-scalp-serum","assets/images/v49/hair-serum.webp","A lightweight leave-on oil serum with rosemary, onion seed and kalonji in jojoba, for the scalp and fine, thinning-looking hair. 30 ml, in black glass with a gold collar.","live"],["Men's Unstitched Suit","product/mens-unstitched-suit","assets/images/v47/suit-men-hero.webp","Five fabrics in Jet Black, Pure White and Steel Grey — as a 4.5-metre length, or stitched to your size by the WAFA SMART TECH 