d sleeves, and a four-border embroidered dupatta — six deep colours.","live"],["The Gift Box for Two","product/the-gift-box-for-two","assets/images/v48b/gift-couple.webp","His and her cotton socks, the Radiance Cream and a jar of Aam ka Murabba — for the two of you.","live"],["Face Wash","product/face-wash","assets/images/v49/face-wash.webp","A gentle daily cleanser that lifts away dust, sunscreen and the day — and never leaves skin tight. 100 ml.","live"],["His & Hers Socks Set","product/his-and-hers-socks","assets/images/eco/socks-life.webp","3 pairs of men's and 3 pairs of women's socks — made to be shared.","live"],["The Office Week Set","product/the-office-week-set","assets/images/eco/office-week.webp","6 vests and 6 pairs of socks — a fresh set for every working day.","live"],["Aam ka Murabba","product/aam-ka-murabba","assets/images/eco/murabba-jar.webp","The mango preserve of Pakistani kitchens — whole raw-mango pieces slow-cooked in saffron and cardamom syrup.","live"],["The Eid Welcome Hamper","product/eid-welcome-hamper","assets/images/eco/set-eid-hamper.webp","Two jars of Aam ka Murabba and the Herbal Radiance Cream — the gift to carry to every Eid visit.","live"],["Herbal Radiance Cream","product/herbal-radiance-cream","assets/images/eco/radiance-cream.webp","A whipped daily face cream with aloe vera and niacinamide, for skin that looks rested, even and softly luminous.","live"],["Organic Baby Care","product/organic-baby-care","assets/images/v3/soon-babycare.webp","Baby lotion, baby oil and baby cream with chamomile, calendula and oat.","launching"],["Seb ka Murabba","product/seb-ka-murabba","assets/images/v48/mur-seb-r.webp","Tender apple pieces slow-cooked in a light saffron and cardamom syrup.","live"],["Her Radiance Gift","product/her-radiance-gift","assets/images/eco/set-her-radiance.webp","The Herbal Radiance Cream with three pairs of women's cotton socks — a gift that feels considered.","live"],["Baby Diapers","product/sfiva-baby-diapers","assets/images/v3/soon-diapers.webp","Ultra-soft, breathable, plant-based diapers for sensitive skin.","soon"],["Bans ka Murabba","product/bans-ka-murabba","assets/images/v48/mur-bans-r.webp","Tender bamboo-shoot slices in a clear, cardamom-scented syrup — the classic of the old pantries.","live"],["Sargodha Kinnow","product/sfiva-fresh-sargodha-kinnow","assets/images/v52/fresh/kinnow.webp","Sargodha's own Kinnow, picked with their leaves — a 10 kg WAFA SMART TECH Fresh carton, or twelve in the orchard box.","soon"],["Herbal Face Serum","product/herbal-face-serum","assets/images/eco/face-serum.webp","Saffron and bakuchiol in a light amber serum, 30 ml — the evening companion to the Radiance Cream.","launching"],["Amla ka Murabba","product/amla-ka-murabba","assets/images/v48/mur-amla-r.webp","Whole Indian gooseberries in thick golden syrup — one each morning, the way grandmothers advise.","live"],["Pomegranates · Anar","product/sfiva-fresh-pomegranates","assets/images/v52/fresh/pomegranate.webp","Deep-red pomegranates, heavy with juice — nine to the orchard box, each in its own ivory nest, or a 5 kg carton.","live"],["Herbal Body Oil","product/herbal-body-oil","assets/images/eco/body-oil.webp","Kalonji and sweet almond, 100 ml — a warm, silky oil for after the bath.","soon"],["Gajar ka Murabba","product/gajar-ka-murabba","assets/images/v48/mur-gajar-r.webp","Red winter carrots in a glossy saffron syrup — the season, in a jar.","live"],["Kala Kulu Apples","product/sfiva-fresh-kala-kulu-apples","assets/images/v52/fresh/apples.webp","The dark-red Kala Kulu, crisp and sweet — twelve to the orchard box in ivory nests, or a 5 kg carton.","live"],["Herbal Beard Oil","product/herbal-beard-oil","assets/images/eco/soon-beard-oil.webp","Cold-pressed oils with cedar and rosemary for a soft, well-kept beard.","soon"],["The Murabba Gift Box","product/the-murabba-gift-box","assets/images/v48/mur-box-r.webp","Mango, apple, amla and carrot murabba — four jars in the black-and-gold WAFA SMART TECH gift box.","live"],["Guavas · Amrood","product/sfiva-fresh-guavas","assets/images/v52/fresh/guava.webp","Fragrant winter guavas, pink and white inside — twelve to the orchard box with their leaves, or a 5 kg carton.","live"],["Oud Attar","product/oud-attar","assets/images/eco/soon-oud.webp","Aged oud and rose, hand-blended in Dubai, in a crystal attar bottle.","soon"],["The Dates Selection","product/the-dates-selection","assets/images/v48/dates-box.webp","Ajwa, Medjool, Mabroom and Sukkari — hand-selected, each in its gold cup, in the black WAFA SMART TECH box.","live"],["Persimmons · Japani Phal","product/sfiva-fresh-persimmons","assets/images/v52/fresh/persimmon.webp","Honey-sweet Japani phal with their green crowns — nine to the orchard box in ivory nests, or a 5 kg carton.","live"],["Cold-Pressed Canola Oil","product/cold-pressed-canola-oil","assets/images/eco/soon-canola-oil.webp","Pressed cold from canola seed — light, clean-tasting and made for everyday cooking. 1 litre.","soon"],["Cold-Pressed Mustard Oil","product/cold-pressed-mustard-oil","assets/images/eco/soon-mustard-oil.webp","Desi sarson ka tail, pressed cold for its true flavour — for tarka, achar and saag. 1 litre.","soon"],["Sidr Honey","product/sidr-honey","assets/images/eco/soon-honey.webp","Rich, dark sidr honey in a hexagonal glass jar — pure, from the source.","soon"],["Malta Oranges · 5 kg","product/sfiva-fresh-malta","assets/images/v48/fr-malta.webp","Glossy winter Malta from the orchards of Punjab, packed by hand in the WAFA SMART TECH Fresh carton.","live"],["Kids' Cotton Socks","product/kids-cotton-socks","assets/images/eco/soon-kids-socks.webp","Soft pastel cotton socks with stars, whales and rainbows.","soon"],["Bananas · 5 kg","product/sfiva-fresh-bananas","assets/images/v48/fr-bananas.webp","Ripe, unblemished bananas — a full 5 kg box for the family, packed in the WAFA SMART TECH Fresh carton.","live"],["Cotton Loungewear Set","product/cotton-loungewear-set","assets/images/eco/soon-loungewear.webp","A piped cotton pyjama set in champagne, boxed for gifting.","soon"],["The Seasonal Fruit Hamper","product/sfiva-fresh-seasonal-hamper","assets/images/v52/fresh/hamper.webp","The best fruit of the season, gift-boxed in the black-and-gold WAFA SMART TECH hamper — it changes with the calendar.","live"],["Egyptian Cotton Towels","product/egyptian-cotton-towels","assets/images/eco/soon-towels.webp","Plush hotel-grade towels with an embroidered gold monogram.","soon"],["Chaunsa Mangoes · 5 kg","product/sfiva-fresh-chaunsa-mango","assets/images/v48/fr-mango.webp","Chaunsa, the king of mangoes — nine to the orchard box in ivory nests, or a 5 kg WAFA SMART TECH Fresh carton.","soon"],["Tissues & Towels","product/sfiva-tissues","assets/images/v3/soon-tissues.webp","Soft facial tissues and kitchen towels from our own production.","soon"],["Rosemary & Onion Scalp Mask","product/rosemary-onion-scalp-mask","assets/images/v46/soon-scalp-mask.webp","A rich weekly scalp mask with rosemary, red onion and kalonji — the hair ritual, concentrated.","soon"],["Saffron Kahwa","product/saffron-kahwa","assets/images/v46/soon-saffron-kahwa.webp","Green tea with saffron, cardamom, cinnamon and almond — the kahwa of a Kashmiri welcome.","soon"],["Cotton Thermal Set","product/cotton-thermal-set","assets/images/v46/soon-thermal-set.webp","A long-sleeve top and long johns in charcoal waffle-knit cotton — warm without bulk under every outfit.","soon"],["Cotton Camisole","product/cotton-camisole","assets/images/v46/soon-camisole.webp","Fine jersey-knit cotton camisoles with adjustable straps, in ivory and blush.","soon"],["Muslin Swaddle Set","product/muslin-swaddle-set","assets/images/v46/soon-swaddle-set.webp","Three breathable cotton muslin swaddles in white, sage and sand, boxed with a knitted hat.","soon"],["Turkish Cotton Bathrobe","product/turkish-cotton-bathrobe","assets/images/v46/soon-bathrobe.webp","A heavy waffle-weave bathrobe in Turkish cotton, embroidered with the WAFA SMART TECH monogram.","soon"],["Oud Wood Chips","product/oud-wood-chips","assets/images/v46/soon-oud-chips.webp","Resinous oud wood chips for the mabkhara, in a faceted black glass jar.","soon"],["The Dry Fruit Reserve","product/dry-fruit-reserve","assets/images/v46/soon-dry-fruit-box.webp","Eight compartments of almonds, pistachios, cashews, walnuts, raisins, apricots, figs and chickpeas in the octagonal black-and-gold WAFA SMART TECH box.","live"],["Herbal Lip Balm","product/herbal-lip-balm","assets/images/v46/soon-lip-balm.webp","Beeswax, rose and honey in a slim gold-capped tube.","soon"],["Sindhri Aam ka Achaar","product/sindhri-aam-ka-achaar","assets/images/v47/achaar-aam.webp","Royal Mango Pickle — raw Sindhri mango in mustard oil with fennel, nigella and whole red chilli.","live"],["Almonds","product/sfiva-almonds","assets/images/v49/almonds.webp","Premium whole almonds, sweet and crisp, sealed in the black-and-gold WAFA SMART TECH tin. 500 g.","live"],["Nimbu ka Achaar","product/nimbu-ka-achaar","assets/images/v47/achaar-nimbu.webp","Golden Lemon Pickle — whole lemon quarters cured in mustard oil with turmeric and red chilli.","live"],["Pistachios","product/sfiva-pistachios","assets/images/v49/pistachios.webp","Roasted and lightly salted pistachios in their shells, in the black-and-gold WAFA SMART TECH tin. 500 g.","live"],["Lehsan ka Achaar","product/lehsan-ka-achaar","assets/images/v47/achaar-lehsan-r.webp","Royal Garlic Pickle — whole peeled garlic cloves in red-chilli mustard oil.","live"],["Cashews","product/sfiva-cashews","assets/images/v49/cashews.webp","Large whole cashews, creamy and crisp, in the black-and-gold WAFA SMART TECH tin. 500 g.","live"],["Bharwan Hari Mirch","product/bharwan-hari-mirch-achaar","assets/images/v47/achaar-mirch.webp","Stuffed Green Chilli Pickle — plump green chillies filled with a golden spice masala.","live"],["Walnuts","product/sfiva-walnuts","assets/images/v49/walnuts.webp","Light walnut kernels, mild and buttery, in the black-and-gold WAFA SMART TECH tin. 500 g.","live"],["Shahi Mix Achaar","product/shahi-mix-achaar","assets/images/v47/achaar-shahi.webp","Royal Mixed Pickle — mango, carrot, lemon, green chilli and cauliflower in spiced mustard oil.","live"],["Anjeer · Dried Figs","product/sfiva-anjeer","assets/images/v49/anjeer.webp","Soft, plump dried figs, naturally sweet, in the black-and-gold WAFA SMART TECH tin. 400 g.","live"],["The Achaar Gift Box","product/the-achaar-gift-box","assets/images/v48/achaar-box.webp","Sindhri mango, golden lemon and the royal mix — three jars in the emerald-and-gold WAFA SMART TECH gift box.","live"]],"waBase":"https://wa.me/9232466627054","freeDeliveryBottles":0,"upsell":true,"waAe":"https://wa.me/9232466627054?text=Hello%20WAFA SMART TECH%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20place%20an%20order.","customer":null,"accounts":{"discount":10},"chat":{"greeting":"Assalam-o-alaikum! I am the WAFA SMART TECH concierge. Ask me about any product, a price, delivery, payment or your order.","deliveryPk":"2–4 working days · Pakistan nationwide","deliveryAe":"1–2 working days · across the UAE","cod":true,"card":true,"paypal":false,"ingredients":[["Virgin Coconut Oil",34],["Red Onion Extract",18],["Kalonji Black Seed",14],["Methi Dana",12],["Cold-Pressed Mustard",10],["Curry Leaf",7],["Fresh Aloe Vera",5]],"faqs":[["How often should I use it?","Two to three times a week is the sweet spot. Warm a little between your palms, work it into the scalp in small circles for three or four minutes, leave it at least an hour — overnight is better — then wash out with a mild shampoo."],["How long until I notice anything?","Most people say the scalp feels calmer and less itchy within the first week or two. Changes you can see in the mirror take longer, because hair grows roughly a centimetre a month. Give it a full eight-week course before you judge it, which is why the three-bottle pack is the one we recommend."],["Does it smell of onion?","No. We use a cold onion extract rather than pressed juice, and the kalonji and curry leaf carry the scent. It smells herbal and warm — closest to a traditional champi oil."],["Will it make my hair greasy?","It is an oil, so it will feel rich going on. It is light enough to sleep in without ruining a pillowcase, and one wash with a mild shampoo clears it completely."],["Is it safe for coloured or chemically treated hair?","Yes. There is nothing in the blend that strips colour. If your scalp is currently irritated from a treatment, wait until it has settled and patch-test first."],["Can men use it?","Yes, and many do. The routine is identical."],["What is in it, exactly?","Seven cold-pressed botanicals and nothing else: coconut, red onion, kalonji, fenugreek, mustard, curry leaf and aloe vera. No mineral oil, no silicones, no synthetic fragrance, no parabens."],["Should I patch-test?","Please do, especially if you have sensitive skin or a known allergy to any of the seven botanicals. Put a little behind the ear, leave it 24 hours, and check for a reaction before using it on the scalp."],["How do I pay, and can I pay cash?","You can pay by card through Stripe, or choose cash on delivery in Pakistan and the UAE. Card orders ship with complimentary delivery."],["What if I want to return it?","See our refund and returns policy — unopened bottles can be returned within 14 days of delivery."],["What is the price of WAFA SMART TECH hair oil in Pakistan?","Today's prices for the single bottle, the three-bottle pack and the larger pack are shown in the shop section above — the bigger the pack, the less you pay per bottle. Delivery is free when you pay by card; with cash on delivery a small delivery charge is added at checkout."],["Do you deliver to my city in Pakistan?","Yes. We deliver across Pakistan — Lahore, Karachi, Islamabad, Rawalpindi, Faisalabad, Multan, Peshawar, Quetta, Sialkot, Gujranwala, Hyderabad, Bahawalpur, Abbottabad and everywhere in between — with cash on delivery available in every city."],["Is onion oil or kalonji oil better for hair?","They do different jobs, which is why WAFA SMART TECH uses both. Red onion extract brings sulphur compounds that support the scalp, and kalonji (black seed) is rich in the antioxidant thymoquinone and conditioning fatty acids. Blended in cold-pressed coconut oil, together with fenugreek, mustard, curry leaf and aloe, they are lighter and far more pleasant to use than either oil on its own."],["Does it help with hair fall?","WAFA SMART TECH is a cosmetic hair oil, not a medicine. Used two to three times a week, it nourishes the scalp and strengthens the lengths, and most customers notice less breakage and softer, glossier hair over eight weeks. If you are losing hair suddenly or in patches, please see a dermatologist."],["How do I track my order?","You receive your order number by email (and WhatsApp once we dispatch). Enter it with your phone number on the Track order page, or ask the concierge on this site, to see every step from confirmed to delivered, with the courier tracking link."]],"email":"info@wafasmart.tech"}};</script> <script>(function(){var v=document.querySelectorAll('video[data-lazy-poster]');if(!v.length)return;function put(x){var p=x.getAttribute('data-lazy-poster');if(!p)return;x.setAttribute('poster',p);if(x.hasAttribute('data-lazy-bg'))x.style.backgroundImage="url('"+p+"')";x.removeAttribute('data-lazy-poster');}
function near(x){var c=x.closest('a,article,li,.ugc-card')||x,n=c;for(var k=0;k<4&&n;k++){n=n.nextElementSibling;if(n){var w=n.querySelector&&n.querySelector('video[data-lazy-poster]');if(w)put(w);}}}
if(!('IntersectionObserver' in window)){for(var i=0;i<v.length;i++)put(v[i]);return;}
var io=new IntersectionObserver(function(es){es.forEach(function(e){if(e.isIntersecting){put(e.target);near(e.target);io.unobserve(e.target);}});},{rootMargin:'700px 400px'});for(var j=0;j<v.length;j++)io.observe(v[j]);})();(function(){var f=document.querySelectorAll('.fit');if(!f.length)return;if(!('IntersectionObserver' in window)){for(var i=0;i<f.length;i++)f[i].classList.add('fit-on');return;}
var io=new IntersectionObserver(function(es){es.forEach(function(e){if(e.isIntersecting){e.target.classList.add('fit-on');io.unobserve(e.target);}});},{rootMargin:'500px 300px'});for(var j=0;j<f.length;j++)io.observe(f[j]);})();(function(){if(!('IntersectionObserver' in window))return;var s=document.querySelectorAll('main > section, body > footer');var io=new IntersectionObserver(function(es){es.forEach(function(e){e.target.classList.toggle('anim-rest',!e.isIntersecting);});},{rootMargin:'120px 0px'});for(var i=0;i<s.length;i++)io.observe(s[i]);})();</script> <script src="sfiva.min.js?v=5.5.1.1793311828" defer></script> <script>  /* ---------- rotating 3D cube ---------- */
  var cube = document.getElementById("cube");
  var stage = document.getElementById("cubeStage");
  var dots = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll(".cube-dot"));
  var faces = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll(".face"));
  var live = document.getElementById("cube-live");
  var reduceMotion = window.matchMedia ? window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)") : { matches: false };
  var items = faces.map(function (face) {
    return {
      title: (face.querySelector(".f-title") || {}).textContent || "Product",
      price: (face.querySelector(".f-price") || {}).textContent || ""
    };
  });
  var index = 0;
  var duration = 8000;
  var frameDelay = duration / faces.length;
  var offsetMs = 0;

  function updateClasses(active) {
    index = active;
    dots.forEach(function (dot, i) {
      dot.setAttribute("aria-pressed", i === active ? "true" : "false");
    });
    faces.forEach(function (face, i) {
      face.classList.toggle("is-active", i === active);
      face.toggleAttribute("inert", i !== active);
    });
    if (live) live.textContent = items[active].title + " — " + items[active].price;
  }

  function goTo(active) {
    if (!cube || !faces.length) return;
    active = ((active % faces.length) + faces.length) % faces.length;
    cube.classList.remove("is-spinning");
    cube.style.animation = "none";
    cube.style.transform = "translateZ(calc(var(--w)/-2)) rotateX(-14deg) rotateY(" + (-active * 90) + "deg)";
    offsetMs = active * frameDelay;
    updateClasses(active);
    window.requestAnimationFrame(function () {
      cube.style.animation = "";
      cube.style.animationDelay = (-(active * frameDelay / 1000)) + "s";
      cube.classList.add("is-spinning");
    });
  }

  dots.forEach(function (dot, i) {
    dot.addEventListener("click", function () { goTo(i); });
  });

  if (stage) {
    var start = null;
    var swiped = false;

    stage.addEventListener("pointerdown", function (e) {
      if (e.button && e.button !== 0) return;
      start = { x: e.clientX, y: e.clientY };
    });

    stage.addEventListener("pointerup", function (e) {
      if (!start) return;
      var dx = e.clientX - start.x;
      var dy = e.clientY - start.y;
      start = null;
      if (Math.abs(dx) > 40 && Math.abs(dx) > Math.abs(dy) * 1.15) {
        swiped = true;
        goTo(index + (dx < 0 ? 1 : -1));
        window.setTimeout(function () { swiped = false; }, 80);
      }
    });

    stage.addEventListener("pointercancel", function () { start = null; });
    stage.addEventListener("click", function (e) {
      if (swiped) { e.preventDefault(); e.stopPropagation(); }
    }, true);
  }

  if (cube) {
    cube.classList.add("is-spinning");
    if ("IntersectionObserver" in window && stage) {
      new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
        cube.classList.toggle("is-offscreen", !entries[0].isIntersecting);
      }, { threshold: 0.05 }).observe(stage);
    }
  }

  function syncActive() {
    if (!cube || !faces.length || !cube.getAnimations) return;
    var anims = cube.getAnimations();
    if (!anims.length) return;
    var t = (anims[0].currentTime || 0) + offsetMs;
    var progress = ((t % duration) / duration + 1) % 1;
    var active = Math.round(progress * faces.length) % faces.length;
    if (active !== index) updateClasses(active);
  }

  updateClasses(0);
  window.setInterval(syncActive, 250);

  /* ---------- scroll reveals ---------- */
  var revealEls = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll(".reveal"));
  if ("IntersectionObserver" in window) {
    var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries, obs) {
      entries.forEach(function (entry) {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          entry.target.classList.add("in");
          obs.unobserve(entry.target);
        }
      });
    }, { threshold: 0.12, rootMargin: "0px 0px -6% 0px" });
    revealEls.forEach(function (el) { io.observe(el); });
  } else {
    revealEls.forEach(function (el) { el.classList.add("in"); });
  }

  /* ---------- count-up stats ---------- */
  var counters = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll(".count[data-count]"));
  function finalCount(el) { el.textContent = el.getAttribute("data-count"); }
  function animateCount(el) {
    var target = Number(el.getAttribute("data-count")) || 0;
    var startTime = null;
    var duration = 1450;
    function step(now) {
      if (startTime === null) startTime = now;
      var p = Math.min(1, (now - startTime) / duration);
      var eased = 1 - Math.pow(1 - p, 3);
      el.textContent = String(Math.round(target * eased));
      if (p < 1) {
        window.requestAnimationFrame(step);
      } else {
        el.textContent = String(target);
      }
    }
    window.requestAnimationFrame(step);
  }

  if (reduceMotion.matches) {
    counters.forEach(finalCount);
  } else if ("IntersectionObserver" in window) {
    counters.forEach(function (el) { el.textContent = "0"; });
    var co = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries, obs) {
      entries.forEach(function (entry) {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          animateCount(entry.target);
          obs.unobserve(entry.target);
        }
      });
    }, { threshold: 0.5 });
    counters.forEach(function (el) { co.observe(el); });
  } else {
    counters.forEach(animateCount);
  }

  /* ---------- touch / hover 3D tilt on service cards ---------- */
  var tiltCards = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll("[data-tilt]"));
  tiltCards.forEach(function (card) {
    var touching = false;
    card.addEventListener("pointermove", function (e) {
      if (reduceMotion.matches) return;
      if (e.pointerType === "touch" && !touching) return;
      var r = card.getBoundingClientRect();
      if (!r.width || !r.height) return;
      var px = (e.clientX - r.left) / r.width - 0.5;
      var py = (e.clientY - r.top) / r.height - 0.5;
      card.style.setProperty("--ry", (px * 9).toFixed(2) + "deg");
      card.style.setProperty("--rx", (-py * 7).toFixed(2) + "deg");
    });
    card.addEventListener("pointerdown", function (e) {
      if (e.pointerType === "touch") touching = true;
    });
    ["pointerup", "pointercancel", "pointerleave"].forEach(function (ev) {
      card.addEventListener(ev, function () {
        touching = false;
        card.style.setProperty("--rx", "0deg");
        card.style.setProperty("--ry", "0deg");
      });
    });
  });
})();
</script></script>
</body> </html> 